Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:09.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As pedras de Mardin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:17.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.34,0:07:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...comecei a pensar que ela era minha, minha legítima esposa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:32.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.79,0:07:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:46.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.02,0:07:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Diga agora mesmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:49.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.61,0:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:21.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.56,0:08:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Liguei para o seu pai, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe-me falar com você também.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:37.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.47,0:08:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, eu também não consegui falar. Não deve ter sinal onde ele está.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:38.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.34,0:08:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Use o fogo, então.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:40.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.61,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:42.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.83,0:08:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Você já sabe que nada vai dar errado.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:45.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.73,0:08:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Todo mundo sabe, mãe. Por que você não sabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:49.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.70,0:08:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vá lá com sua bicicleta, espertinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:56.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.07,0:08:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que será que não estou nada tranquila?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:05.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.99,0:09:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que ficou calado, então? Por que não nos perguntou nada?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:17.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.82,0:09:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran quis assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.65,0:09:20.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.77,0:09:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,O Boran quis assim, é?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:25.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.79,0:09:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele disse: "Se um dia eu morrer, me esconda".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:28.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.99,0:09:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou explicar agora, vocês sabem o motivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:29.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.67,0:09:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,E eu o escondi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:40.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.71,0:09:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:48.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.24,0:09:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu e o Boran nos conhecemos na Bulgária.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:51.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.29,0:09:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estava nas sombras, e ele estava fugindo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:52.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.87,0:09:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Não perguntei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:53.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.07,0:09:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dava para ver nos olhos dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:55.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.71,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele tinha um passado difícil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:58.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.14,0:09:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu o ajudei a sair dessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:00.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.98,0:10:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois, eu também me meti em confusão.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:02.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.81,0:10:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tive problemas com a máfia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:04.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.56,0:10:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós dois fugimos para o Canadá.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:07.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.37,0:10:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele abriu um restaurante e eu fiquei com ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:10.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.10,0:10:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No começo, ele era reservado.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.02,0:10:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois, ele passou a confiar em mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:14.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.20,0:10:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Um dia ele perguntou: "Quer ser meu segurança?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:17.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.33,0:10:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele saiu vivo, afinal, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:24.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.40,0:10:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.43,0:10:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela estava desmaiada, não viu nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:42.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.54,0:10:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No dia do acidente, eu estava no carro logo atrás.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:45.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.96,0:10:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No meu próprio veículo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:48.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.14,0:10:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Um dos meus homens estava comigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:51.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.49,0:10:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois da batida, nós corremos para lá.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:53.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.39,0:10:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A Dona Alya estava desmaiada.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.00,0:10:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran também estava inconsciente.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:10:57.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.53,0:10:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele estava gravemente ferido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:10:59.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Colocamos o Boran no meu carro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:03.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.73,0:11:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois, esmaguei a cabeça do homem que estava comigo com um pé de cabra.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixei o rosto dele irreconhecível.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:09.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.94,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ömer Bakır.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:11.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.69,0:11:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso mesmo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:13.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.88,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,O marido da mulher sobre quem vocês vivem perguntando.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:17.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.46,0:11:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tirei as roupas dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:18.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Peguei a identidade dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:21.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.98,0:11:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Vesti o Ömer com as roupas do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:22.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.26,0:11:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,O coloquei sentado ao lado da Dona Alya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:24.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.97,0:11:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,E coloquei a identidade do Boran no bolso dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:27.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.01,0:11:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,E no Boran, coloquei as roupas e a identidade do Ömer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:29.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.68,0:11:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ainda não tinha acordado.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:31.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.22,0:11:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Liguei para a ambulância.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:32.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.28,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Dei o aviso.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois, saí de lá com o Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.37,0:11:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Para onde eu o levei?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu o internei em um hospital particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ficou em coma por meses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:45.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.21,0:11:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,E depois, ficou em estado vegetativo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:51.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.32,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,E por que escondeu tudo isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:54.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.84,0:11:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não nos avisou? Diga!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:55.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.33,0:11:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já disse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:56.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.58,0:11:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele me disse para não falar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.58,0:11:57.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.70,0:11:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinha muita gente atrás dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:12:00.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Não dava para saber se ele sobreviveria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:01.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.11,0:12:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Então eu me calei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:03.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.23,0:12:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,E então?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.72,0:12:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,E por que voltei agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:05.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.50,0:12:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu tempo no Canadá acabou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu o trouxe comigo quando vim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:12.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.73,0:12:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dê um jeito nisso.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:13.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.34,0:12:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele reconhece? Você já o viu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:14.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.86,0:12:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, ele não reconhece.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:28.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.05,0:12:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Infelizmente, ele não reage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:02.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.38,0:13:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vamos fazer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:24.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos levá-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:27.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.80,0:13:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Para os da mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:29.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.21,0:13:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Para a senhora Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:30.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.45,0:13:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Para a cunhada Alya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:34.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.89,0:13:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos contar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:36.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.18,0:13:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem que contar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:41.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.27,0:13:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,É difícil dizer, mas ele pode não sobreviver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:54.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.91,0:13:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai viver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.26,0:13:56.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.38,0:13:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós o manteremos vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.28,0:13:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Faremos o impossível para salvá-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:13:59.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.50,0:13:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez recorramos a métodos antigos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.87,0:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Se Deus quiser, querida.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.31,0:14:03.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.43,0:14:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Se Deus quiser, Ele é grande.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:06.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.77,0:14:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós também faremos o possível, claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.52,0:14:08.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu vi o estado dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:15.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.20,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nesse estado, não sabemos quanto tempo ele resiste.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:20.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.64,0:14:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já perdi um filho.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:23.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.19,0:14:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabe disso.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.66,0:14:28.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.78,0:14:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Se o Boran viver e acordar, aí você conta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:30.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.42,0:14:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Não conte nada agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.34,0:14:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Não faça isso, eu te imploro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.49,0:14:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você contar, todos virão atrás dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:38.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A polícia, os Baybars...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:40.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.41,0:14:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Afinal, o Boran matou o Süleyman Baybars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:42.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.87,0:14:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo menos, vamos escondê-lo em outro lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:46.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.67,0:14:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém além de nós vai saber.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.02,0:14:50.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.14,0:14:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Cala a boca, é o Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:29.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.22,0:15:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem mais alguém que sabe que ele tá vivo além de você?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:07.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.50,0:16:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Além de mim e do Erol, ninguém vai saber.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:15.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.08,0:16:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparem o avião, façam os preparativos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:17.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.36,0:16:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos levar o Boran para Mardin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:21.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.46,0:16:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa isso comigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:22.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.71,0:16:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Considere feito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:24.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.97,0:16:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,O tratamento dele vai continuar na empresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:28.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.05,0:16:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas irmão, a empresa não vai dar problema? Podem ver ele lá.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.93,0:16:30.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.05,0:16:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Lá é o lugar mais seguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:33.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.87,0:16:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Não temos como proteger de outro jeito. Tem que ficar diante dos nossos olhos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:34.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.52,0:16:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos levá-lo para dentro de noite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:35.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.27,0:16:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Em silêncio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.08,0:16:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:40.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.15,0:16:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa com a gente.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:44.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.68,0:16:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Só você sabe que ele está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.38,0:16:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa isso para lá.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:10.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.89,0:17:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Passe esses no barbante.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:19.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, meu cordeirinho curioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos secá-los no sol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:24.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.29,0:17:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,E no inverno faremos charutos para comer juntos com gosto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.05,0:17:24.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.17,0:17:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,É...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.99,0:17:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,E milho também?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:28.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.39,0:17:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro que penduro, meu bem. Se você pedir, eu penduro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.57,0:17:29.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.69,0:17:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente assiste a um filme...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:31.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...e come pipoca croc croc, tá bom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.47,0:17:33.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.59,0:17:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vocês estão comendo croc croc, deixa eu ver?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.87,0:17:35.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.99,0:17:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você tá comendo no croc croc?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:39.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.79,0:17:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, a gente vai comer milho, mas só quando secar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:41.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.59,0:17:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:42.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.71,0:17:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Croc croc.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:44.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.78,0:17:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha vida, o que você tá fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:47.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.02,0:17:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, nós estávamos preparando as coisas para o inverno.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:49.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.82,0:17:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Resolvemos nos adiantar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:50.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.36,0:17:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,É o momento certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:52.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.74,0:17:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,O aniversário da morte do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.54,0:17:54.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Essas coisas nem têm a ver com isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:57.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.62,0:17:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, ainda faltam dois anos, se Deus quiser nós vamos resolver tudo isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:58.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai começar agora, vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:17:59.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.64,0:17:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai você.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:17:59.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.30,0:17:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:01.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.92,0:18:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Está bem, Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:01.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.98,0:18:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá, ele também.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, é sobre a morte do meu pai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.61,0:18:08.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.73,0:18:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, nós vamos conversar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:09.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.46,0:18:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:12.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.19,0:18:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,É o aniversário de morte do seu pai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:13.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.91,0:18:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A sua mãe não te contou?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:16.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.17,0:18:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos conversar agora, vovó.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:16.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.16,0:18:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.98,0:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, então ela não contou, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:19.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.46,0:18:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo visto ela mesma se esqueceu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:23.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakize!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:24.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.93,0:18:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode levar o Deniz, por favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:29.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.52,0:18:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha, querido.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:31.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.44,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim esquecer, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:33.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.16,0:18:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que eu esqueceria?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.87,0:18:34.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.99,0:18:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem como esquecer uma coisa dessas?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:35.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.53,0:18:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a senhora está insinuando?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:38.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.73,0:18:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo tem a sua hora, Dona Sadakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:38.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.28,0:18:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou a mãe dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:41.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.42,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sou eu quem decide quando e o que conversar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:42.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.48,0:18:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei qual é o momento certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:45.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.84,0:18:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que a senhora fica caçando oportunidade para ferir o meu filho?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:46.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.34,0:18:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Que oportunidade?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:47.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.35,0:18:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Que mentira é essa que você está dizendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:49.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.66,0:18:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Você simplesmente não contou para o menino.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:50.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.81,0:18:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Cihan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:52.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.45,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora você chama o seu tio Cihan de pai, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:53.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.79,0:18:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não ouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:54.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.43,0:18:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não é o seu pai de verdade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:55.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.55,0:18:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,O seu pai é o Boran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:56.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.67,0:18:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a senhora está fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:59.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.21,0:18:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Alguém aqui negou isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.89,0:19:00.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.01,0:19:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que está gritando isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.29,0:19:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Alguém por acaso negou, dona Sadakat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Saia daqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:06.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.85,0:19:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Assim não dá. Pra fora!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:08.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.49,0:19:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem você pensa que é para me dar ordens, hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.83,0:19:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, eu fiquei quieta com o que houve com a Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:15.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.20,0:19:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei em silêncio sofrendo, com a consciência pesada, mas não foi por vocês!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:20.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.06,0:19:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Me calei pela sua família, me calei por esta casa, me calei pelo Cihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:24.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.64,0:19:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não vou poupar ninguém, vou à polícia se não sair. Saia daqui agora!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:27.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.86,0:19:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Se continuar fazendo isso, eu te denuncio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:28.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.13,0:19:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pra fora!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:31.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.05,0:19:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Está me ameaçando?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:34.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou sair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:38.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.57,0:19:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não por medo, e sim pensando no meu neto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:40.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.23,0:19:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensando nada! Pra fora!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:47.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.17,0:19:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Você... você...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:52.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.12,0:19:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:55.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.14,0:19:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chegou cedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:56.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.58,0:19:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,É.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.14,0:19:56.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.26,0:19:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:58.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Senti sua falta.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.18,0:20:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sei... Faz um café para tomarmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:04.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.02,0:20:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Você bebe café demais. Já preparei a comida.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.21,0:20:05.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.33,0:20:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come primeiro, depois eu faço. Pode ser?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.65,0:20:08.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.77,0:20:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa. Onde está a Nare?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:17.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.48,0:20:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sei lá. Ela acabou de sair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.31,0:20:21.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.43,0:20:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim acabou de sair? Falou alguma coisa para ela?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.65,0:20:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você fez de novo, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.66,0:20:25.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.78,0:20:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha aqui! Não jogue a culpa de tudo em mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:28.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Não admite que falem nada da sua mulher, né? Que beleza.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:29.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.76,0:20:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro que eu perguntei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:31.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.92,0:20:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Por acaso eu não te conheço?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:33.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.98,0:20:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro que perguntei. Ele ficou me encarando com cara de tacho.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:35.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.58,0:20:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Virou as costas e foi embora. O que eu podia fazer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:38.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.50,0:20:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Em vez de me enfrentar, cuide dessa sua barriga, ouviu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:39.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.04,0:20:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Poxa, irmã...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:44.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.77,0:20:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez ele não tenha suportado o fato de a mãe ser uma assassina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:48.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.48,0:20:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Não teve coragem de olhar na nossa cara, largou tudo e sumiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:49.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.74,0:20:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Em silêncio, sem dizer nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:50.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.10,0:20:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomara a Deus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.22,0:20:52.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.34,0:20:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus queira, meu Senhor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.01,0:20:56.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.13,0:20:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Para onde ele foi sem te avisar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:20:57.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.97,0:20:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Liga para ele agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:58.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.00,0:20:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde será que ele foi se meter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.82,0:21:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Misericórdia, meu Deus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:07.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.34,0:21:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois não, Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:13.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.43,0:21:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde você está, Nare?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.99,0:21:15.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.11,0:21:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vim até a mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:16.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.71,0:21:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você foi para a mansão?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:20.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.23,0:21:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois eu te explico, está bem? Conversamos depois.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.43,0:21:22.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.55,0:21:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não avisou que ia?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.56,0:21:26.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.68,0:21:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu precisava avisar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:27.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.60,0:21:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare, pelo que nós passamos?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.09,0:21:30.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.21,0:21:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a gente está vivendo, pelo amor de Deus? Não aja como se tivesse esquecido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:33.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.71,0:21:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,E se não deixarem você sair de lá?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:36.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.66,0:21:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha aqui, se você não voltar em uma hora, eu vou bater nessa porta, fique sabendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.35,0:21:40.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.47,0:21:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, eu vou voltar. Está bem. Por favor. Por favor, se acalme. Eu vou voltar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:42.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.65,0:21:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Como vou me acalmar? Estou preocupado com você.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.09,0:21:44.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.21,0:21:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, depois a gente se fala.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:53.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.48,0:21:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Naci.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:02.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.08,0:22:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está bem? Bem-vinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.15,0:22:08.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.27,0:22:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, seja bem-vinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:09.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.56,0:22:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vim para conversar com a minha mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:12.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.53,0:22:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Vim para falar sobre a Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:15.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.76,0:22:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi ela quem fez isso, não foi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:18.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.62,0:22:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi ela quem matou a Mine, não foi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:22.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.06,0:22:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, minha filha, fui eu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.76,0:22:28.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.88,0:22:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fui eu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:31.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.56,0:22:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, como a senhora pôde fazer isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.95,0:22:37.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.07,0:22:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, como a senhora foi capaz de fazer isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:40.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.01,0:22:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Filha, por que você está agindo desse jeito, tão surpresa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:41.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.08,0:22:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você me ligou?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:44.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.90,0:22:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você me ligou então, Nare?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:46.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.80,0:22:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, eu liguei para o Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:47.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.90,0:22:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu liguei para o meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:49.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.92,0:22:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu liguei para você porque não consegui falar com eles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:52.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu liguei para você porque não tive escolha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.18,0:22:53.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.30,0:22:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, não teve escolha?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:54.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.80,0:22:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não me conhece, minha filha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:59.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.00,0:22:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não sabia como eu ia dar um jeito naquela mulher?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:02.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.58,0:23:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabia muito bem, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:06.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.14,0:23:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você sabia ainda melhor é que, quando Ecmel descobrisse que era pai do Boran,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.72,0:23:10.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.84,0:23:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,tudo ia virar um inferno, não é, minha filha?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.77,0:23:12.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.89,0:23:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Aí você não poderia mais ficar do lado do Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.97,0:23:14.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.09,0:23:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não quis arriscar, não é?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:18.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.40,0:23:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquela mulher precisava ser detida.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.24,0:23:19.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.36,0:23:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fui eu quem fez.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:21.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.69,0:23:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Em vez de me acusar, devia me agradecer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:24.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.12,0:23:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, todo mundo está dizendo que a senhora é uma assassina.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.78,0:23:26.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.90,0:23:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, todo mundo está te chamando de assassina.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:27.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.88,0:23:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,O verdadeiro assassino é o Ecmel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.06,0:23:29.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.18,0:23:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O verdadeiro assassino é ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.56,0:23:35.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.68,0:23:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele maldito tirou a vida do meu filho injustamente e o colocou debaixo da terra.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:37.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.74,0:23:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,O verdadeiro assassino é ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.78,0:23:42.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.90,0:23:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, com a morte da Mine, tudo o que escondemos veio à tona.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.05,0:23:44.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.17,0:23:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu vou dizer para essa gente?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.49,0:23:46.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:44.61,0:23:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não vai dizer nada a ninguém, minha filha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.89,0:23:49.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.01,0:23:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai voltar para a nossa mansão, vai voltar para a nossa casa, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.91,0:23:52.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.03,0:23:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te disse mil vezes que não dá, que não vai dar certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.65,0:23:54.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:52.77,0:23:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Com o Şahin não dá, minha filha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.52,0:23:57.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:55.64,0:23:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Estes ainda são os seus dias melhores.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.12,0:23:59.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.24,0:23:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai viver o verdadeiro inferno naquela mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.91,0:24:02.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:01.03,0:24:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, eu não posso voltar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.47,0:24:05.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:04.59,0:24:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não pode.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.47,0:24:08.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:06.59,0:24:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vá viver no inferno, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.52,0:24:19.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:14.64,0:24:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,O aniversário de morte do meu irmão Boran está chegando e eu...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.85,0:24:23.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:20.97,0:24:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu quero estar aqui naquele dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.68,0:24:27.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:24.80,0:24:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê? O que você está dizendo, Nare?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.83,0:24:32.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:28.95,0:24:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Filha, o que a sua boca diz está chegando aos seus ouvidos, Nare?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.50,0:24:33.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:32.62,0:24:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está dizendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.62,0:24:38.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.74,0:24:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai se aliar aos assassinos do meu filho Boran e depois vir para a reza, minha filha?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.48,0:24:42.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.60,0:24:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu irmão vai se revirar no túmulo, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.86,0:24:45.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:42.98,0:24:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, ele é meu irmão, ele é meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.92,0:24:47.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:46.04,0:24:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Então você vai fazer o que for preciso, minha filha.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.04,0:24:52.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:48.16,0:24:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai voltar para a nossa mansão ou então suma, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:24:56.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:24:54.45,0:24:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, por favor, não faça isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.93,0:25:20.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:19.05,0:25:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vai acontecer na reza?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:24.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.92,0:25:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare, Nare, minha querida, venha.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.49,0:25:29.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:25.61,0:25:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Espere, por favor, não se desgaste tanto assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.71,0:25:30.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:29.83,0:25:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.04,0:25:35.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:31.16,0:25:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, eu não aguentei mais ficar preocupada achando que algo ia acontecer com você.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.01,0:25:35.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.13,0:25:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.19,0:25:39.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:37.31,0:25:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem dera eu não me preocupasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.51,0:25:40.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.63,0:25:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei, eu sei.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.59,0:25:46.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:45.71,0:25:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde estão meus irmãos?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.17,0:25:48.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:47.29,0:25:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão foi para a Síria.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.26,0:25:54.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:49.38,0:25:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Não sei, ele não disse nada, mas... acho que foi por causa de algum carregamento.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.86,0:25:58.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:55.98,0:25:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayla, eu preciso falar com o meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.63,0:26:01.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.75,0:26:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer dizer, ele precisa me entender.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.66,0:26:03.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:26:01.78,0:26:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu preciso estar aqui naquele dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.78,0:26:07.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:26:03.90,0:26:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Na reza do meu irmão, com toda a família, eu também preciso estar.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.78,0:26:08.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:26:07.90,0:26:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é importante para mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.74,0:26:11.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:26:08.86,0:26:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro que é importante, claro que você vai estar aqui.
