Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.14,0:43:28.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:43:26.26,0:43:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Se Deus quiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.33,0:44:04.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.45,0:44:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sejam bem-vindos.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.37,0:44:05.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:04.49,0:44:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,O bebê nasceu.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.75,0:44:07.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:05.87,0:44:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Os bebês nasceram.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.25,0:44:09.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:07.37,0:44:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,São gêmeos. Uma menina e um menino.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.16,0:44:12.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:09.28,0:44:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, que gracinha. Que Deus os crie com saúde junto dos pais.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.34,0:44:13.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:12.46,0:44:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Amém.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.18,0:44:15.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:13.30,0:44:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nosso pequeno príncipe também está lá em cima no quarto dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.18,0:44:17.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.30,0:44:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A Pakize o alimentou, deve estar dormindo agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.34,0:44:19.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:17.46,0:44:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou dar uma olhada nele agora, com licença.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.11,0:44:23.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:20.23,0:44:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, o Cihan também tá lá fora, ou tá em cima?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.29,0:44:24.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:23.41,0:44:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, ele não veio.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.41,0:44:28.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:24.53,0:44:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas o Muzaffer ligou, disseram que vão se atrasar, foram pra empresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.63,0:44:30.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:29.75,0:44:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.50,0:44:32.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:31.62,0:44:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.68,0:44:37.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:32.80,0:44:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu imaginava que seria difícil, mas não imaginei que tanto.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.72,0:44:48.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:44.84,0:44:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles tinham razão. Já começou errado desde o início.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.28,0:44:59.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:44:56.40,0:44:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Você pensa assim mesmo de verdade?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.41,0:45:05.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:02.53,0:45:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Você pensa assim mesmo de verdade?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.04,0:45:09.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:07.16,0:45:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nada disso é errado.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.08,0:45:11.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:10.20,0:45:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,E nada é impossível.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.41,0:45:16.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:13.53,0:45:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo o que precisávamos fazer era nos apegar um ao outro.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.87,0:45:17.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:15.99,0:45:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Era acreditar um no outro.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.71,0:45:21.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:18.83,0:45:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você não acredita mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.67,0:45:23.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:21.79,0:45:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A era de Eşah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.86,0:45:24.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.98,0:45:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega mais perto do seu pai.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.98,0:45:26.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:24.10,0:45:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei sozinha bem no meio de dois fogos.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.60,0:45:28.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:26.72,0:45:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,De um lado sua mãe, do outro meu pai.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.90,0:45:31.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:29.02,0:45:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma me ataca a cada oportunidade e a outra me acolhe.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.26,0:45:33.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:31.38,0:45:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ainda não sei o que fazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.18,0:45:35.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:33.30,0:45:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare, eu não sei de que lado ficar.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.10,0:45:36.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:35.22,0:45:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só tinha uma certeza, e essa certeza era você.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.50,0:45:39.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:37.62,0:45:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Era em você que eu ia me guiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.45,0:45:42.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:39.57,0:45:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu perdi a minha bússola, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.13,0:45:45.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.25,0:45:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós entregamos a Mine para a sua mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.84,0:45:51.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:48.96,0:45:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós fomos a causa daquela morte.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.90,0:45:53.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.02,0:45:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu calei a boca por sua causa.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.65,0:45:55.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:53.77,0:45:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Engoli aquele tapa por sua causa.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.91,0:45:57.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:55.03,0:45:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você continua calada.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.92,0:46:00.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.04,0:46:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem algo que você sabe e não está me dizendo, eu sei.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.97,0:46:03.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:00.09,0:46:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu comecei a duvidar de tudo, até de mim mesma.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.76,0:46:07.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:05.88,0:46:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fala logo isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.21,0:46:10.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:09.33,0:46:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Fala, eu vou enlouquecer, Nare, fala.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.79,0:46:12.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:10.91,0:46:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fala.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.81,0:46:18.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:15.93,0:46:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, eu não posso falar.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.30,0:46:32.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:30.42,0:46:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, olha, eu não posso.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.35,0:46:40.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:37.47,0:46:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, se eu falar, tudo desmorona.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.25,0:46:42.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:40.37,0:46:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu juro por Deus que tudo vai por água abaixo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.57,0:46:43.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:42.69,0:46:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua família se acaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.49,0:46:44.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:43.61,0:46:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha mãe se acaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.47,0:46:45.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:44.59,0:46:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,O passado desmorona.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.41,0:46:46.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:45.53,0:46:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,O futuro desmorona.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.72,0:46:48.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:46.84,0:46:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela é obrigada a ficar em silêncio.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.21,0:46:49.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:48.33,0:46:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha vontade
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.85,0:46:50.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:48.97,0:46:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,de respirar...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.53,0:46:57.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:55.65,0:46:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquilo que você cala
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.24,0:46:59.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:58.36,0:46:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,talvez seja
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.90,0:46:59.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:59.02,0:46:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,o caminho que eu escolhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.76,0:47:02.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:46:59.88,0:47:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Você me deixou na escuridão.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.63,0:47:04.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:47:02.75,0:47:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu devo fazer?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.51,0:47:05.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:47:04.63,0:47:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do lado de quem eu devo ficar?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.63,0:47:06.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:47:05.75,0:47:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu já não sei de mais nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.57,0:47:08.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:47:06.69,0:47:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.67,0:47:23.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:47:20.79,0:47:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu faço isso todos os dias.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.66,0:48:10.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:07.78,0:48:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Para os músculos não enfraquecerem.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.18,0:48:11.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:10.30,0:48:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Para o sangue circular.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.28,0:48:12.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:11.40,0:48:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Só para ter algum movimento.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.18,0:48:14.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:12.30,0:48:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Para que, se um dia
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.14,0:48:15.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:14.26,0:48:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,ele voltar a se levantar,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.24,0:48:17.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:15.36,0:48:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,ele possa continuar
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.18,0:48:19.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:18.30,0:48:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,de onde parou.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.20,0:48:21.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:19.32,0:48:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora você vai protestar, Bora.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.53,0:48:24.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:22.65,0:48:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai ficar galã, meu garoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.95,0:48:29.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:27.07,0:48:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Quanto vai dar?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.14,0:48:30.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:30.26,0:48:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.94,0:48:35.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:33.06,0:48:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu amor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.17,0:48:37.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:48:36.29,0:48:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.77,0:49:56.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:49:54.89,0:49:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Está tudo bem?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.43,0:51:21.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:18.55,0:51:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu falei, o Muzaffer deve ter comentado.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.86,0:51:25.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:23.98,0:51:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês ainda estão na empresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.43,0:51:28.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:26.55,0:51:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Já passou da meia-noite, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.21,0:51:35.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:32.33,0:51:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu alguma coisa por aí também?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.70,0:51:43.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:38.82,0:51:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Se eu fiz alguma besteira, pode falar, não vou ficar bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.28,0:51:45.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:44.40,0:51:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Só fala.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.24,0:51:46.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:45.36,0:51:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou curioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.34,0:51:50.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:49.46,0:51:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.36,0:51:51.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:50.48,0:51:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada disso.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.26,0:51:55.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:52.38,0:51:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Estávamos em reunião e acabou estendendo um pouco na empresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.79,0:51:58.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:51:56.91,0:51:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Já vou, mas vou sair daqui a pouco.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.49,0:52:05.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:03.61,0:52:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Senti sua falta.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.19,0:52:28.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:26.31,0:52:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Até mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.12,0:52:41.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:52:39.24,0:52:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado por assistirem.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.14,0:56:13.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:11.26,0:56:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Serão distribuídas provisões nas casas para Bora.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.00,0:56:14.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:13.12,0:56:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No dia seguinte, será servido o almoço.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.90,0:56:18.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:16.02,0:56:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,E à noite, serão feitas orações no Mevlid na mansão.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.75,0:56:22.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:20.87,0:56:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A Nare veio.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.60,0:56:25.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:23.72,0:56:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Quis participar do Mevlid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.18,0:56:26.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:25.30,0:56:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não permiti.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.10,0:56:27.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:26.22,0:56:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês também não vão permitir.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.34,0:56:30.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:28.46,0:56:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem se senta à mesma mesa com os assassinos de Bora
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.76,0:56:33.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:30.88,0:56:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,não tem o direito de rezar pela alma de Bora.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.52,0:56:35.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:34.64,0:56:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou cansado, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.32,0:56:36.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:35.44,0:56:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.88,0:56:36.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:36.00,0:56:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou deitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.35,0:56:38.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:37.47,0:56:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa eu ler uma resposta.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.81,0:56:59.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:56:57.93,0:56:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.92,0:57:09.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:57:07.04,0:57:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Perdi minhas chaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.29,0:57:59.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:57:57.41,0:57:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Que toque.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.24,0:59:14.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:09.36,0:59:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que ele dormiu muito profundo, porque já passa dessa hora.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.04,0:59:34.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:32.16,0:59:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ia a uma vila.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.66,0:59:36.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:35.78,0:59:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.35,0:59:37.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:36.47,0:59:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu fui.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.94,0:59:40.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:38.06,0:59:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu passei.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.72,0:59:42.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:41.84,0:59:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Que bom.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.50,0:59:45.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:44.62,0:59:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A mulher teve 8 filhos.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.60,0:59:53.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:49.72,0:59:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe o Anıl aproveitar o pai um pouco.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.88,0:59:54.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:54.00,0:59:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Amém.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.98,1:00:01.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:59:58.10,1:00:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, eu também estou sofrendo à beça.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.40,1:00:02.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:01.52,1:00:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.77,1:00:04.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:02.89,1:00:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai me contar?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.51,1:00:06.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:04.63,1:00:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem nada acontecendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.48,1:00:09.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:07.60,1:00:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele falou com você.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.06,1:00:09.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:09.18,1:00:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.10,1:00:12.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:10.22,1:00:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Há um problema no carregamento na fronteira, mas se Deus quiser vamos resolver.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.59,1:00:15.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:13.71,1:00:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, não tem mais nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.63,1:00:16.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:15.75,1:00:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem mais nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.24,1:00:21.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:18.36,1:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando você diz que não tem nada assim...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.97,1:00:25.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:23.09,1:00:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fico ainda mais certa de que tem alguma coisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.35,1:00:26.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:25.47,1:00:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.04,1:00:30.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:28.16,1:00:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.82,1:00:35.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:31.94,1:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te conheço mais por esse seu silêncio, por esse lugar onde você se cala.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.83,1:00:36.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:35.95,1:00:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem alguma coisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.89,1:00:40.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:38.01,1:00:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, eu estou tentando entender.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.09,1:00:41.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:41.21,1:00:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu pensei.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.65,1:00:44.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:42.77,1:00:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensei muito e disse:
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.20,1:00:46.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:44.32,1:00:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"Deve ter acontecido algum problema na Síria."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.00,1:00:47.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:46.12,1:00:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,É.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.16,1:00:51.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:46.28,1:00:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ou sei lá, será que eles estão transportando contrabando numa blitz da gendarmeria?" - pensei.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.15,1:00:53.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:51.27,1:00:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é como se não pudessem fazer contrabando na estrada à luz do dia.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.86,1:00:56.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:53.98,1:00:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu já entendi que não tem a ver com isso, Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.25,1:01:03.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.37,1:01:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,O motivo de você estar desviando os olhos de mim, se afastando e não se aproximando assim não é esse.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.48,1:01:05.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:04.60,1:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consigo explicar com isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.59,1:01:09.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:07.71,1:01:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem é que o carregamento atrasou nem nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.53,1:01:11.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.65,1:01:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada relacionado ao trabalho, tem outra coisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.31,1:01:15.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:14.43,1:01:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.21,1:01:30.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:25.33,1:01:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Se há alguma mágoa nos olhos da minha mãe, eu entendo, eu estou entendendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.01,1:01:54.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:50.13,1:01:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ficamos no telefone e você disse "vamos dormir juntos".
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.72,1:01:57.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:54.84,1:01:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Naquela época, meus olhos brilhavam, por exemplo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.91,1:02:00.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:01:57.03,1:01:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Você já tinha querido ficar comigo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.21,1:02:07.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.33,1:02:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sem o seu passado, sem nenhum medo, você quis ficar só comigo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.74,1:02:12.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:07.86,1:02:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pela primeira vez, eu tinha percebido de novo pelo seu olhar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.08,1:02:19.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:17.20,1:02:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mais uma vez, você tinha me feito sentir com os seus olhos.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.08,1:02:20.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.20,1:02:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora eu também estou entendendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.24,1:02:22.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:22.36,1:02:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.98,1:02:33.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:29.10,1:02:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anda, venha, vamos conversar, vamos sentar e conversar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.44,1:02:35.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:33.56,1:02:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Me conte qual é o seu problema.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.83,1:02:36.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:35.95,1:02:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Me conte.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.73,1:02:44.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:42.85,1:02:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Droga, preciso.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.64,1:02:58.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:53.76,1:02:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está calado assim porque o aniversário de morte está chegando, não é?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.83,1:03:03.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:02:59.95,1:03:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,É por isso que você foge, é por isso que você se cala.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.31,1:03:23.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:21.43,1:03:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Aonde você vai?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.41,1:03:27.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:26.53,1:03:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou tomar um ar.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.85,1:03:34.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:30.97,1:03:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan! Cihan, aonde vai? Não me faça gritar.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.78,1:03:36.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:34.90,1:03:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você está fazendo isso comigo?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.21,1:03:38.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:37.33,1:03:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu quero saber.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.47,1:03:45.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:38.59,1:03:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Só quero saber se é porque o aniversário do Boran está chegando, ou o que quer que seja.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.98,1:03:52.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:03:50.10,1:03:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu só caminhei um pouco, só isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.82,1:04:09.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:04:05.94,1:04:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Como eu disse, não é por causa do Boran.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.12,1:05:09.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:05:06.24,1:05:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Por causa disso você está magoado.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.76,1:06:04.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:02.88,1:06:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.65,1:06:23.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:18.77,1:06:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Com licença, cunhada, me desculpe por ter começado, mas preciso sair mais cedo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.08,1:06:24.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:23.20,1:06:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Não diga bobagem, bom apetite.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.97,1:06:26.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:25.09,1:06:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde está o Cihan?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.60,1:06:28.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:26.72,1:06:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda está dormindo, não acordou.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.99,1:06:31.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:29.11,1:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estava perguntando do meu marido, estava perguntando do meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.71,1:06:34.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:32.83,1:06:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele saiu cedo, tem coisas para resolver na empresa.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.01,1:06:37.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:35.13,1:06:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai comer halva, vou preparar.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.88,1:06:41.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:38.00,1:06:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele saiu sem dizer um olá, sem dar bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.92,1:06:44.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:42.04,1:06:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Temos trabalho na empresa, mãe, estamos ocupados.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.59,1:06:50.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:47.71,1:06:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim tenho que sair?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.51,1:06:54.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:53.63,1:06:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom apetite.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.87,1:06:55.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:54.99,1:06:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.63,1:06:58.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:56.75,1:06:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou te dar um pastel de pinheiro.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.55,1:06:59.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:58.67,1:06:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quero, obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.80,1:07:00.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:06:59.92,1:07:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.93,1:07:07.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:05.05,1:07:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.24,1:07:13.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:11.36,1:07:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan veio ao quarto ontem à noite.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.15,1:07:17.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:14.27,1:07:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Se isso não nos diz respeito, por que ainda fugimos?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.91,1:07:21.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:19.03,1:07:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está fugindo de você, não é assim.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.52,1:07:25.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:23.64,1:07:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Desde o começo estava claro que seria assim.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.51,1:07:28.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:26.63,1:07:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,E dizer que ama é fácil.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.37,1:07:30.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:28.49,1:07:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A sombra do passado é longa.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.95,1:07:32.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:31.07,1:07:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês não podem simplesmente ignorá-la.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.73,1:07:36.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:33.85,1:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan está com peso na consciência.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.41,1:07:41.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:37.53,1:07:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ficar tão destruído no aniversário da morte dele é por isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.88,1:07:42.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:41.00,1:07:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Por sua culpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.85,1:07:50.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:42.97,1:07:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Quanto mais você toca o coração dele, mais ele sente como se estivesse apunhalando o Boran pelas costas.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.11,1:07:53.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:51.23,1:07:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está machucando a minha escola.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.32,1:08:00.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:07:58.44,1:08:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é a maldição dele.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.30,1:08:05.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:03.42,1:08:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tinha que ir embora.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.10,1:08:13.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:09.22,1:08:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ficar é um fardo tanto para ele quanto para você.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.00,1:08:20.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:18.12,1:08:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, bom apetite.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.70,1:08:33.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:31.82,1:08:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Aydin Can.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.25,1:08:45.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:44.37,1:08:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.69,1:08:54.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:08:51.81,1:08:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Você se casou com a senhora Aliye.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.04,1:09:06.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:04.16,1:09:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou ciente da situação.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.01,1:09:17.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:13.13,1:09:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran te disse para me proteger caso conseguisse escapar.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.79,1:09:24.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:21.91,1:09:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele também me disse para proteger a Aliye e casar com ela se algo lhe acontecesse.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.40,1:09:33.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:28.52,1:09:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém escreve um testamento para si mesmo enquanto está vivo, Can.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.85,1:09:38.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:35.97,1:09:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Escreve para aqueles que ficam.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.32,1:09:43.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:38.44,1:09:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo que entendemos, enfermeira, você pode sair quando quiser se for vir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.39,1:09:51.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:09:49.51,1:09:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou te segurar, você tinha o seu pai.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.45,1:10:09.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:04.57,1:10:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Viver com o medo de que algumas coisas virem cinzas é uma coisa, mas...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.04,1:10:23.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:20.16,1:10:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas deixar a mulher que você ama para o seu irmão, o que é isso?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.11,1:10:28.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:25.23,1:10:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Como uma coisa dessas saiu da sua boca?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.29,1:10:32.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:29.41,1:10:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Como você pôde dizer uma coisa dessas?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.60,1:10:42.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:38.72,1:10:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Faz desde ontem que eu te ligo e seu celular está desligado.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.75,1:10:44.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:42.87,1:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não pensou em me ligar de volta?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.25,1:10:46.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:44.37,1:10:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estava ocupada, o que foi que você não entendeu?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.11,1:10:47.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:46.23,1:10:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Não minta para mim.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.85,1:10:50.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:47.97,1:10:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te liguei tanto, o mínimo que você podia fazer era retornar.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.97,1:10:52.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:51.09,1:10:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem uma mensagem sequer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.19,1:10:55.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:52.31,1:10:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Estávamos na Síria, o celular não pega lá, você sabe.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.33,1:11:03.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:10:55.45,1:11:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Se fosse avisar que ia, sou eu que tenho que te ligar sempre? Ai, meu Deus. Eu estou dizendo que não tenho tempo? Surgiu um problema, o assunto é a Zerrin e o Kaya. Não importa o que você diga, por mais que negue, essa sua frieza comigo é por causa dela, você não conseguiu esquecê-la.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.59,1:11:22.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:19.71,1:11:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está dizendo?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.54,1:11:50.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:48.66,1:11:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabe muito bien o que estou dizendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.16,1:11:52.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:50.28,1:11:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Você escondeu de mim?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.87,1:11:54.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:51.99,1:11:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanto o relacionamento de vocês quanto o passado?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.30,1:11:57.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:54.42,1:11:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Não havia nada para esconder.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.86,1:11:58.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:56.98,1:11:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Então quer dizer que ainda tem alguma coisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.78,1:12:01.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:11:58.90,1:12:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,İpek, nada disso é como você está pensando.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.33,1:12:02.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:01.45,1:12:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,É exatamente como estou pensando.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.47,1:12:05.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:02.59,1:12:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Se você também tivesse se afastado de vez...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.73,1:12:07.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:05.85,1:12:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ainda não olharia para trás por sua causa.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.63,1:12:10.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:07.75,1:12:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não consegue olhar para nós por sua culpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.20,1:12:13.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:10.32,1:12:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A cabeça dele ainda está em você por sua culpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.27,1:12:15.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:13.39,1:12:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não tem vergonha nenhuma, garota?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.59,1:12:17.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:15.71,1:12:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Você se casou.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.59,1:12:19.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:17.71,1:12:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Está grávida.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.90,1:12:21.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:19.02,1:12:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Saia do pé do Kaya de uma vez.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.85,1:12:24.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:21.97,1:12:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe o rapaz em paz.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.82,1:12:26.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:24.94,1:12:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe a gente em paz.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.76,1:12:30.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:26.88,1:12:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Não há nada entre nós e eu não vou ficar repetindo isso mil vezes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.17,1:12:32.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:30.29,1:12:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Chega, parem de ficar me atormentando.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.81,1:12:34.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:31.93,1:12:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dınar, por que você está indo?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.75,1:12:54.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:51.87,1:12:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou indo ver o Kete.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.45,1:12:58.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:56.57,1:12:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou falar com o meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.96,1:13:00.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:12:58.08,1:13:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha aqui, você não está entendendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.07,1:13:02.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:00.19,1:13:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles não nos aceitam. Por que você insiste em ir até a porta deles?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.80,1:13:05.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:02.92,1:13:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin Gülveren é parceiro do meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.87,1:13:07.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:04.99,1:13:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também quero estar lá.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.88,1:13:13.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:11.00,1:13:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero estar com eles na mansão.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.02,1:13:18.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:16.14,1:13:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A culpa é sua.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.55,1:13:44.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:13:42.67,1:13:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.86,1:14:21.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:19.98,1:14:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Fui eu que causei isso, né?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.65,1:14:23.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:21.77,1:14:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês brigaram por causa disso.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.33,1:14:25.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:23.45,1:14:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Me desculpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.86,1:14:38.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:14:34.98,1:14:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso também tem a ver com vocês dois.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.79,1:15:08.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:06.91,1:15:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, escuta.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.81,1:15:16.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:12.93,1:15:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada do que você está pensando.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.26,1:15:17.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:16.38,1:15:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você acha que é?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.59,1:15:21.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:17.71,1:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Achei que o motivo de Zerrin falar aquilo era você.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.04,1:15:22.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:21.16,1:15:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,İpek, você não está entendendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.30,1:15:23.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:22.42,1:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu não estou entendendo, hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.63,1:15:25.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:23.75,1:15:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu não entendi? Eu vi com meus próprios olhos.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.92,1:15:29.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:28.04,1:15:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.50,1:15:32.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:30.62,1:15:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vamos contar pro Demir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.41,1:15:35.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:33.53,1:15:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos contar, talvez o Demir entenda.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.76,1:15:39.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:36.88,1:15:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos falar pra ele vir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.02,1:15:39.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:39.14,1:15:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai lá, conta.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.35,1:15:42.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:40.47,1:15:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai lá contar pro Demir o que você quiser, vamos.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.76,1:15:44.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:42.88,1:15:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não pode dizer nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.90,1:15:45.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:44.02,1:15:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa ele falar, eu já me cantei.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.43,1:15:47.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:45.55,1:15:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, eu cansei, parem de ficar no meu pé.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.46,1:15:49.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:47.58,1:15:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai lá e conta o que você quiser contar.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.12,1:15:50.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:49.24,1:15:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninguém vai contar nada a ninguém.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.42,1:15:51.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:50.54,1:15:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Liga pra ele, vamos contar.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.07,1:15:52.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:52.19,1:15:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Liga, vamos contar.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.06,1:15:55.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:54.18,1:15:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.32,1:15:58.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:56.44,1:15:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, aquele Keraçoğlu sempre diz isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.05,1:16:00.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:15:58.17,1:16:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Se atrasarmos mais o nosso pagamento,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.40,1:16:02.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:00.52,1:16:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,eu juro por Deus que dou um tiro nos pés dele.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.24,1:16:02.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:02.36,1:16:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cansou?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.98,1:16:04.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:03.10,1:16:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A ordem também chegou.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.51,1:16:06.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:05.63,1:16:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele também não tem o direito de saber?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.18,1:16:08.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:07.30,1:16:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos contar isso a ele também.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.18,1:16:09.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:08.30,1:16:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos contar logo.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.06,1:16:09.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:09.18,1:16:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,İpek, venha.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.66,1:16:10.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:09.78,1:16:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Faça e solte.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.50,1:16:12.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:10.62,1:16:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Não há nenhum outro significado além do que você viu.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.46,1:16:13.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:12.58,1:16:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Solte isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.06,1:16:13.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:13.18,1:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,De verdade.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.99,1:16:15.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:14.11,1:16:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ponha essa cabeça no lugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.81,1:16:18.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:15.93,1:16:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, estou te fazendo um favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.44,1:16:19.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:18.56,1:16:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Senão você não vai conseguir lidar com isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.23,1:16:34.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:30.35,1:16:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossa, você saiu mais cedo da prova, como foi?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.41,1:16:40.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:38.53,1:16:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,O filho de Kayı está esperando.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.43,1:16:42.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:40.55,1:16:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, vamos saber como o bebê está.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.19,1:16:43.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:42.31,1:16:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.48,1:16:45.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:44.60,1:16:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você é dele, não é?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.31,1:16:47.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:46.43,1:16:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do avião.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.24,1:16:49.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:48.36,1:16:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.08,1:16:51.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:50.20,1:16:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está dizendo?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.74,1:16:53.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:51.86,1:16:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você não conta para o Demir?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.54,1:16:56.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:53.66,1:16:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Em vez de agradecer, está me pedindo satisfações?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.42,1:17:00.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:16:56.54,1:17:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegue, mas veja bem, não há nada como você está pensando.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.83,1:17:10.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:06.95,1:17:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estava mal, ele veio me consolar, foi só isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.19,1:17:14.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:11.31,1:17:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você estava mal então?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.94,1:17:16.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:14.06,1:17:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,İpek está cansada.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.38,1:17:19.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:17.50,1:17:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estou muito cansada.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.44,1:17:25.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:20.56,1:17:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não consigo digerir o que minha família passou, o que acontece na minha família.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.71,1:17:27.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:25.83,1:17:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou muito cansada.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.27,1:17:29.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:27.39,1:17:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pobre.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.26,1:17:32.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:30.38,1:17:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem certeza?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.81,1:17:37.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:31.93,1:17:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Se realmente for como você está dizendo, vamos nos casar agora mesmo.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.97,1:17:59.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:17:57.09,1:17:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Me dê um tempo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.17,1:18:09.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:05.29,1:18:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Me dê um tempo para digerir tudo o que passei.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.69,1:18:23.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:20.81,1:18:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, sou eu, İpek.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.89,1:18:54.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:51.01,1:18:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é isso de falar assim de longe, me chamando de dona Sadakat?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.17,1:18:56.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:55.29,1:18:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Você agora é minha nora.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.10,1:18:58.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:18:57.22,1:18:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai me chamar de mãe.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.22,1:19:02.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:00.34,1:19:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu preciso falar uma coisa com o senhor.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.25,1:19:03.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:02.37,1:19:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cara a cara.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.33,1:19:13.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:10.45,1:19:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é sobre trabalho, é outra coisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.09,1:19:17.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:16.21,1:19:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.57,1:19:20.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:18.69,1:19:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatice, eu quero saber.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.00,1:19:23.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:21.12,1:19:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está assim porque o aniversário da morte do Boran está chegando?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.28,1:19:24.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:23.40,1:19:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, saiba disso.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.23,1:19:24.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:24.35,1:19:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.04,1:19:29.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:26.16,1:19:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele está fugindo de você, não está?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.09,1:19:33.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:31.21,1:19:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava claro desde o início que seria assim.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.35,1:19:35.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:33.47,1:19:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan está com peso na consciência.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.59,1:19:39.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:35.71,1:19:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele ficar tão desestruturado assim no aniversário de morte do Boran é por causa disso.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.01,1:19:41.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:40.13,1:19:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Por sua culpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.59,1:19:48.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:40.71,1:19:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Quanto mais você toca o coração dele, mais ele sente como se estivesse esfaqueando o Boran pelas costas.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.16,1:19:50.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:19:48.28,1:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está machucando ele.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.56,1:20:44.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:20:39.68,1:20:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, Cihan, temos um problema que precisamos resolver agora.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.80,1:21:36.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:21:32.92,1:21:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Alya, seja bem-vinda. Cihan, emergência.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.06,1:21:40.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:21:37.18,1:21:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,O sistema de refrigeração deu defeito. O seguro não cobre a pane.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.04,1:21:43.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:21:40.16,1:21:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Você precisa assinar este documento agora mesmo, senão toda a responsabilidade vai cair sobre nós.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.28,1:21:49.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:21:44.40,1:21:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A situação é urgente, ou seja, Cihan precisa assinar este documento agora.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.55,1:21:53.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:21:50.67,1:21:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Para nós, assim que um problema acaba, o fim do mundo começa.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.70,1:22:10.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:07.82,1:22:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você veio fazer aqui de novo?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.44,1:22:25.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:23.56,1:22:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vim falar com meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.85,1:22:27.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:24.97,1:22:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão não vai falar com você assim. Vamos, vá embora.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.22,1:22:28.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:27.34,1:22:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu disse que vou falar.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.72,1:22:29.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:28.84,1:22:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.52,1:22:37.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:30.64,1:22:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Enquanto você ficar naquela mansão daquele sem-vergonha do Ecmel, meu irmão não vai falar com você.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.70,1:22:46.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:45.82,1:22:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Não espere à toa, vá embora.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.72,1:22:47.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:46.84,1:22:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cala a boca, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.30,1:22:47.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:47.42,1:22:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.76,1:22:48.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:47.88,1:22:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya, já chega.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.29,1:22:50.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:49.41,1:22:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ainda sou irmã dele.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.24,1:22:53.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:51.36,1:22:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou falar sim, amanhã é a cerimônia do meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.05,1:22:55.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:54.17,1:22:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu quero estar na mansão.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.83,1:23:01.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:22:58.95,1:23:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim, que cerimônia?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.42,1:23:04.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:02.54,1:23:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,É o aniversário de morte do nosso irmão, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.91,1:23:05.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:05.03,1:23:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanhã tem a cerimônia.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.03,1:23:08.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:07.15,1:23:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também quero estar lá.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.27,1:23:10.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:09.39,1:23:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também vou rezar pelo meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.38,1:23:15.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:12.50,1:23:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Só porque fui para a mansão do Ecmel...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.60,1:23:18.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:15.72,1:23:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês acham que eu esqueci o Boran?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.16,1:23:20.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:19.28,1:23:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu amor por ele diminuiu?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.31,1:23:22.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:20.43,1:23:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também estou sofrendo.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.06,1:23:26.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:23.18,1:23:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda estou aguentando, Kaya, eu sinto tanto a falta do meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.92,1:23:28.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:27.04,1:23:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya, eu vou.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.51,1:23:30.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:28.63,1:23:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu quero estar na cerimônia.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.67,1:23:32.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:30.79,1:23:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Então não espere, vamos logo.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.44,1:23:34.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:33.56,1:23:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya, o que foi?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.43,1:23:37.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:35.55,1:23:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu com você? Aconteceu alguma coisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.99,1:23:41.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:23:39.11,1:23:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.88,1:24:39.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:24:38.00,1:24:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Passa, Gece abla.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.55,1:25:24.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:25:22.67,1:25:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Acabei de pegar.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.79,1:26:06.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:02.91,1:26:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você demorou tanto para vir?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.13,1:26:32.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:30.25,1:26:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que é porque você fugiu, querida?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.45,1:26:35.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:33.57,1:26:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está fugindo.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.93,1:26:42.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:41.05,1:26:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Está fugindo de novo.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.01,1:26:42.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:42.13,1:26:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Halil.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.82,1:26:45.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:42.94,1:26:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, você não é assim.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.58,1:26:48.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:46.70,1:26:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu? Por favor, me conta.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.50,1:26:50.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:48.62,1:26:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, eu vou enlouquecer.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.86,1:26:51.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:49.98,1:26:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Você nunca fugia.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.98,1:26:54.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:52.10,1:26:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não usa esse caminho.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.74,1:26:57.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:54.86,1:26:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Não importa o que acontecesse, você nunca fugia.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.23,1:26:59.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:57.35,1:26:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Não importa o que escondesse de mim, você não fugia.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.33,1:27:00.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:26:59.45,1:27:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem mesmo no caso da Mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.66,1:27:03.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:00.78,1:27:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Quanto mais você escondia as coisas de mim, mais você vinha para cima.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.10,1:27:05.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:03.22,1:27:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Você discutia, peitava, batia de frente.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.28,1:27:06.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:05.40,1:27:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas nem uma vez sequer você fugiu.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.36,1:27:09.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:07.48,1:27:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu agora para você estar fugindo? Por favor, me diz.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.17,1:27:15.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:12.29,1:27:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, responde à minha pergunta.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.09,1:27:18.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:16.21,1:27:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá fazendo isso pra eu confiar em você amanhã?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.76,1:27:22.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:19.88,1:27:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,É por isso que você é tão valiosa?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.71,1:27:28.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:26.83,1:27:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.06,1:27:32.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:30.18,1:27:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim não é? Como é então?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.92,1:27:33.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:32.04,1:27:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,O que quer dizer com "não é assim"?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.83,1:27:35.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:33.95,1:27:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você tá fazendo isso comigo?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.13,1:27:37.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:36.25,1:27:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você tá falando assim?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.71,1:27:39.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:37.83,1:27:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você tá me deixando sozinho?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.93,1:27:39.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:39.05,1:27:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi que você me disse?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.42,1:27:42.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:40.54,1:27:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Você me disse que...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.46,1:27:44.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:42.58,1:27:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"Se eu não consigo me aproximar de você tanto assim..."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.64,1:27:46.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:44.76,1:27:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"...o motivo não é o peso desse amor", você disse.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.82,1:27:55.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:47.94,1:27:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Você me disse: "Quero me acostumar a carregar ao seu lado a culpa que você vai carregar depois que o Boran morreu".
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.92,1:27:59.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:27:57.04,1:27:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também disse: "Eu peço o mundo inteiro para enfrentar por você".
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.70,1:28:04.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:01.82,1:28:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse: "Meu Deus, eu te amo com todo o meu coração".
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.46,1:28:08.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:05.58,1:28:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você tá agindo assim agora?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.23,1:28:13.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:11.35,1:28:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Você ainda pensa assim?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.08,1:28:17.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:13.20,1:28:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim, pelo menos? Você ainda pensa assim?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.23,1:28:23.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:21.35,1:28:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consegue dizer?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.02,1:28:29.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:28.14,1:28:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Você diz que não tem coragem.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.52,1:28:31.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:28:30.64,1:28:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou embora.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.28,1:29:05.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:05.40,1:29:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.86,1:29:18.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:15.98,1:29:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tá bem? Tá bem, Nare?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.83,1:29:29.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:28.95,1:29:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem, calma.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.29,1:29:33.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:32.41,1:29:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tá bem?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.00,1:29:35.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:34.12,1:29:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada, não é nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.58,1:29:36.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:35.70,1:29:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bem?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.91,1:29:38.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:37.03,1:29:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.56,1:29:41.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:39.68,1:29:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem aqui, solta isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.01,1:29:44.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:43.13,1:29:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Solta isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.38,1:29:48.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:46.50,1:29:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Traga uma colônia, Nare.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.61,1:29:50.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:49.73,1:29:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Traga.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.25,1:29:52.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:51.37,1:29:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.52,1:29:57.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:29:54.64,1:29:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Inala um pouco, cheira um pouco.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.17,1:30:02.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:01.29,1:30:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu amor, o que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.17,1:30:03.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:02.29,1:30:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você ficou assim?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.21,1:30:06.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:03.33,1:30:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,É que eu ia falar com o meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.87,1:30:12.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:10.99,1:30:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Para estar no funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.29,1:30:12.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:12.41,1:30:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.83,1:30:15.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:12.95,1:30:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando não o vi, eu disse ao Kaya que você não podia vir e tal.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.91,1:30:17.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:16.03,1:30:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi mal, Moise.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.31,1:30:20.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:18.43,1:30:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vocês estão fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.93,1:30:24.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:22.05,1:30:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, Kaya, Cihan, estou falando para os dois.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.50,1:30:25.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:24.62,1:30:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada disso.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.53,1:30:28.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:27.65,1:30:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A Nare tem que vir.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.60,1:30:31.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:29.72,1:30:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês não estão vendo o estado dela, gente?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.24,1:30:32.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:31.36,1:30:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro que ela vai estar com a gente.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.40,1:30:33.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:32.52,1:30:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele era irmão dela.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.05,1:30:36.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:35.17,1:30:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que ela não sente falta do Boran?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.51,1:30:37.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:36.63,1:30:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.25,1:30:40.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:38.37,1:30:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pelo menos não façam isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.08,1:30:45.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:44.20,1:30:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês têm que falar com a sua mãe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.58,1:30:46.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:45.70,1:30:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem que convencê-la.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.78,1:30:47.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:46.90,1:30:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, eu vou falar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.31,1:30:50.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:49.43,1:30:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou falar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.97,1:30:53.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:52.09,1:30:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês, para dentro, vamos.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.40,1:30:54.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:53.52,1:30:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Espere, você tá bem?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.34,1:30:55.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:54.46,1:30:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos para dentro.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.18,1:30:55.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:55.30,1:30:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.86,1:30:56.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:55.98,1:30:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu tô bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.80,1:30:57.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:56.92,1:30:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.20,1:30:58.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:57.32,1:30:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe que ele ajude.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.44,1:31:01.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:30:59.56,1:31:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegue, vamos, passe.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.13,1:31:03.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:02.25,1:31:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare, cuidado.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.05,1:31:04.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:03.17,1:31:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se esforce tanto.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.76,1:31:05.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:04.88,1:31:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai dar tudo certo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.51,1:31:09.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:07.63,1:31:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Como é que pode, hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.50,1:31:11.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:10.62,1:31:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.49,1:31:25.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:23.61,1:31:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas minha Sercin.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.39,1:31:38.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:37.51,1:31:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei que é muito difícil.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.50,1:31:39.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:38.62,1:31:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, como vou ficar calma?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.70,1:31:41.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:39.82,1:31:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sei que é muito difícil, mas sim, o Boran está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.68,1:31:43.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:41.80,1:31:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha esposa.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.85,1:31:43.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:42.97,1:31:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.72,1:31:44.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:43.84,1:31:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.32,1:31:45.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:44.44,1:31:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sente-se.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.62,1:31:46.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:45.74,1:31:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Que sentar, meu irmão?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.50,1:31:49.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:48.62,1:31:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.04,1:31:51.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:49.16,1:31:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão, como vou me sentar?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.16,1:31:53.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:52.28,1:31:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nosso irmão está lá embaixo e está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.77,1:31:55.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:54.89,1:31:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças a Deus.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.46,1:32:00.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:31:58.58,1:31:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, tá bom, tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.54,1:32:05.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:02.66,1:32:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não contou os detalhes?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.00,1:32:06.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:05.12,1:32:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele contou tudo, contou?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.56,1:32:07.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:06.68,1:32:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele contou os detalhes?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.28,1:32:09.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:07.40,1:32:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele contou todos os detalhes, mas isso...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.69,1:32:12.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:09.81,1:32:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não é algo para se acreditar fácil assim.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.13,1:32:13.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:12.25,1:32:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,É obra de Deus, o que eu vou fazer?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.83,1:32:15.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:13.95,1:32:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não sei o que devo sentir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.37,1:32:16.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:15.49,1:32:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare, olha, eu...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.33,1:32:18.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:16.45,1:32:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estou quase enlouquecendo, mas isso é real.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.81,1:32:20.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:18.93,1:32:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu irmão Boran está lá embaixo e está vivo.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.09,1:32:22.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:21.21,1:32:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Então o que nós vamos fazer?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.42,1:32:23.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:22.54,1:32:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,O que nós vamos fazer?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.18,1:32:23.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:23.30,1:32:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não sei.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.36,1:32:25.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:24.48,1:32:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, minha mãe.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.70,1:32:28.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:25.82,1:32:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vamos fazer se a mamãe vir isso, meu irmão?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.21,1:32:29.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:28.33,1:32:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem pense nisso.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.24,1:32:30.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:29.36,1:32:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora não, de jeito nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.43,1:32:31.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:30.55,1:32:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, cunhada.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.01,1:32:33.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:32.13,1:32:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela estava aqui, olha, você não disse nada, né?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.93,1:32:35.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:34.05,1:32:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, não, não disse.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.86,1:32:36.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:35.98,1:32:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não disse.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.68,1:32:39.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:36.80,1:32:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Menina, eu não aguento carregar esse fardo por mais tempo.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.59,1:32:40.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:39.71,1:32:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, eu vou contar.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.79,1:32:41.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:40.91,1:32:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem pensar.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.65,1:32:42.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:41.77,1:32:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, olha, não faça isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.89,1:32:44.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:43.01,1:32:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, não fale agora, irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.17,1:32:45.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:44.29,1:32:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, se acalma.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.27,1:32:46.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:45.39,1:32:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu estou calmo.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.15,1:32:47.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:46.27,1:32:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nare, se tem algo para dizer, diga.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.71,1:32:50.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:47.83,1:32:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas, irmão, ela está lá embaixo daquele jeito.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.89,1:32:54.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:50.01,1:32:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,E se ela não acordar? E se não abrir os olhos, o que vamos fazer?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.06,1:32:55.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:54.18,1:32:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não é um fardo para todo mundo?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.60,1:32:58.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:55.72,1:32:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Se essa verdade vier à tona, não vai ser a nossa ruína, irmão?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.64,1:33:00.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:32:58.76,1:33:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, irmão, não vamos correr esse risco.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.31,1:33:02.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:00.43,1:33:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu vou dizer a ela se ela abrir os olhos agora?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.24,1:33:04.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:03.36,1:33:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,E se ela me perguntar por que eu não contei?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.72,1:33:06.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:04.84,1:33:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não é uma grande injustiça?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.77,1:33:07.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:06.89,1:33:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu vou dizer a ela?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.71,1:33:09.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:07.83,1:33:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,E se ela não abrir os olhos, o que eu vou dizer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.13,1:33:10.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:09.25,1:33:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,E se abrir, o que eu vou dizer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.60,1:33:12.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:10.72,1:33:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,E se não abrir, até quando vai ser assim?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.46,1:33:12.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:12.58,1:33:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.90,1:33:15.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:13.02,1:33:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Digamos que ela não abra os olhos.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.91,1:33:16.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:16.03,1:33:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,O que nós vamos fazer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.75,1:33:18.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:16.87,1:33:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos ficar calados o tempo todo?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.95,1:33:19.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:18.07,1:33:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vamos dizer para a moça?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.27,1:33:20.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:19.39,1:33:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vamos dizer para o filho dela?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.27,1:33:21.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:20.39,1:33:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não é vergonhoso?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.72,1:33:23.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:21.84,1:33:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não é uma injustiça?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.95,1:33:25.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:24.07,1:33:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.21,1:33:27.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:24.33,1:33:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, olha, eu já passei dos limites, tá bom?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.83,1:33:34.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:31.95,1:33:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós vamos manter a calma, tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.10,1:33:36.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:36.22,1:33:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.21,1:33:44.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:42.33,1:33:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Deus é maior, Deus é maior.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.96,1:33:55.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:53.08,1:33:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado, Ümür, obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.98,1:33:58.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:57.10,1:33:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho, parabéns.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.62,1:33:59.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:33:58.74,1:33:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sejam bem-vindos.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.41,1:34:06.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:01.53,1:34:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Em breve vamos tomar um café feito por você também, hein, minha filha.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.06,1:34:08.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:07.18,1:34:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Se Deus quiser, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.51,1:34:09.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:08.63,1:34:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.14,1:34:13.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:11.26,1:34:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat, precisa de mais alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.86,1:34:15.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:13.98,1:34:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, podem ir, Ömür, vamos.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.50,1:34:16.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:15.62,1:34:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom apetite.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.16,1:34:24.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:21.28,1:34:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou tomar muito do tempo de vocês.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.13,1:34:28.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:26.25,1:34:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Que isso, minha filha, fale, estou ouvindo.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.06,1:34:30.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:29.18,1:34:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu amo muito o Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.29,1:34:34.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:32.41,1:34:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas ele é indiferente comigo.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.60,1:34:36.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:35.72,1:34:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora eu descobri o motivo.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.64,1:34:38.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:36.76,1:34:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Era a Zerrin Baybars.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.69,1:34:43.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:39.81,1:34:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada disso, isso foi há muito tempo.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.09,1:34:47.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:45.21,1:34:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas hoje eu os vi abraçados.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.17,1:34:50.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:47.29,1:34:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ou seja, o passado ainda não é passado.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.49,1:34:53.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:50.61,1:34:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoje eu e o Kaya discutimos.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.51,1:34:55.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:53.63,1:34:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Depois eu quis ver o Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.42,1:34:58.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:55.54,1:34:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando voltei, o que vi de repente na minha frente...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.16,1:35:00.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:58.28,1:34:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, minha filha, não precisa me explicar.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.84,1:35:01.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:34:59.96,1:35:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu farei o que for necessário.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.67,1:35:03.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:01.79,1:35:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.73,1:35:06.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:04.85,1:35:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não disse que ama o Kaya, minha filha?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.86,1:35:10.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:08.98,1:35:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês vão se casar o mais rápido possível.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.34,1:35:14.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:10.46,1:35:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você também vai saber como segurar o seu marido.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.03,1:35:17.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:15.15,1:35:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu disse isso mesmo para o Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.11,1:35:20.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:17.23,1:35:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse: "Vamos nos casar logo, para mim tanto faz".
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.32,1:35:25.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:21.44,1:35:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas ele me disse que há situações familiares.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.36,1:35:29.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:28.48,1:35:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem nada disso.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.68,1:35:33.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:30.80,1:35:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanhã é o aniversário de um ano da morte do meu falecido filho Boran.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.68,1:35:36.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:33.80,1:35:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,À noite haverá uma reza, sua família também vai vir, venha você também.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.78,1:35:38.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:36.90,1:35:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Conversamos sobre o assunto do casamento aproveitando a ocasião, hein.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.62,1:35:43.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:41.74,1:35:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, senhora.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.15,1:35:45.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:35:45.27,1:35:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom apetite.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.72,1:36:06.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:02.84,1:36:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Não deixei você ir daquele jeito, querida.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.60,1:36:23.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:21.72,1:36:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, eu já vou mesmo.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.65,1:36:26.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:24.77,1:36:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você ficou chateada então?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.63,1:36:29.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:28.75,1:36:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Boran.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.03,1:36:35.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:33.15,1:36:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está com saudades, né?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.01,1:36:46.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:43.13,1:36:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também estou com muita saudades.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.62,1:36:49.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:48.74,1:36:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, ande.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.54,1:36:52.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:51.66,1:36:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.34,1:36:54.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:36:52.46,1:36:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Alya, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.97,1:37:17.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:13.09,1:37:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Você disse que tinha roupas para lavar, vim buscar as sujas.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.73,1:37:20.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:18.85,1:37:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou fazer você esperar um instante, desculpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.58,1:37:22.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:37:20.70,1:37:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Meus pêsames.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.37,1:38:04.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:02.49,1:38:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.93,1:38:31.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:30.05,1:38:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem veio ver?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.93,1:38:32.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:31.05,1:38:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Vim fazer uma visita ao senhor Ecmel.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.93,1:38:33.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:32.05,1:38:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixe-me avisá-lo, certo.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.61,1:38:37.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:33.73,1:38:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Vieram te fazer uma visita de melhora, pai.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.56,1:38:42.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:41.68,1:38:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem veio?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.68,1:38:44.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:42.80,1:38:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite, melhoras, Nadim.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.68,1:38:46.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:44.80,1:38:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, o que você está fazendo aqui?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.34,1:38:48.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:46.46,1:38:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fora!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.07,1:38:50.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:48.19,1:38:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Como você deixa esse homem entrar?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.27,1:38:53.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:50.39,1:38:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro que ele veio até a porta, não pude mandá-lo embora, me desculpe.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.27,1:38:56.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:53.39,1:38:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês estão brincando comigo, hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.07,1:38:58.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:56.19,1:38:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,O único motivo de eu estar assim é este homem!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.09,1:39:01.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:38:58.21,1:39:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, um minuto. Escuta o homem, cara. Vá em frente, Ecmel, entre.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.88,1:39:03.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:02.00,1:39:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem se atreva.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.03,1:39:07.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:05.15,1:39:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,O motivo não sou eu, Nadim.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.56,1:39:13.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:08.68,1:39:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem deixou você nesse estado foi o Cihan, a Sadakat, o Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.77,1:39:21.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:15.89,1:39:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, não foi você quem me fez dar um tiro no Hamado e me chamou de Nadim, o assassino, hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.35,1:39:24.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:22.47,1:39:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Não foi você quem armou essa cilada para mim?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.21,1:39:25.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:24.33,1:39:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Não fui eu.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.61,1:39:26.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:25.73,1:39:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem foi então?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.11,1:39:29.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:26.23,1:39:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Além disso, essa cilada não é uma armadilha simples como você pensa.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.08,1:39:33.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:30.20,1:39:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez quem tenha armado essa cilada tenha sido o Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.55,1:39:38.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:33.67,1:39:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que ele não planejou isso para nos colocar um contra o outro?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.23,1:39:46.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:44.35,1:39:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein? Será que não?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.26,1:39:52.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:48.38,1:39:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Para me fazer virar as costas para o Emir e destruir nossa parceria.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.97,1:39:56.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:54.09,1:39:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Era o plano da Nacihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.73,1:39:57.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:56.85,1:39:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.99,1:39:59.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:39:58.11,1:39:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pense bem, Nadim.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.84,1:40:05.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:00.96,1:40:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem está jogando com quem, quem está puxando o tapete de quem, pense bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.59,1:40:07.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:06.71,1:40:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Poxa, é capaz.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.77,1:40:11.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:08.89,1:40:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, agora somos consogros.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.58,1:40:12.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:11.70,1:40:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Viramos parentes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.71,1:40:15.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:13.83,1:40:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Um neto está vindo aí em breve.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.13,1:40:19.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:17.25,1:40:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma luz está se abrindo para você, Nadim.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.69,1:40:22.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:20.81,1:40:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos deixar a inimizade.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.19,1:40:24.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:22.31,1:40:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos deixar o rancor de lado.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.40,1:40:28.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:26.52,1:40:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisamos nos unir.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.13,1:40:30.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:29.25,1:40:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,O Cihan está ficando mais forte.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.97,1:40:35.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:30.09,1:40:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Se não nos unirmos, juro por Deus que ele vai destruir todos nós, um por um.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.92,1:40:46.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:41.04,1:40:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Me escute bem. Vamos fazer os carregamentos juntos daqui para frente.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.92,1:40:54.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:52.04,1:40:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hacime, olhe nos meus olhos.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.05,1:41:00.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:40:57.17,1:41:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou me curvar aos seus joguinhos e trapaças.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.96,1:41:03.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:02.08,1:41:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Guarde isso para se torturar.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.89,1:41:07.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:05.01,1:41:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, meu filho, vamos!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.73,1:41:13.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:10.85,1:41:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pense nisso mais um pouco.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.50,1:41:17.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:14.62,1:41:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, meu genro é inteligente.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.71,1:41:19.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:17.83,1:41:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabe distinguir muito bem o certo do errado.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.09,1:41:27.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:24.21,1:41:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu Deus, meu Deus, meu Deus Soğur.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.28,1:41:32.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:29.40,1:41:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te acompanho até a saída, pai.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.90,1:41:37.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:33.02,1:41:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Você falou sobre esse assunto com o meu irmão também, pai?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.92,1:41:41.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:39.04,1:41:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se intrometa. Vá com Deus.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.37,1:41:55.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:52.49,1:41:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece até que você ainda não acredita na minha inocência.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.53,1:42:00.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:41:55.65,1:42:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, a mercadoria que vamos trazer neste último carregamento.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.29,1:42:03.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:02.41,1:42:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,É uma fortuna, uma fortuna.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.60,1:42:08.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:05.72,1:42:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez esse dinheiro facilite para você acreditar, hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.61,1:42:13.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:08.73,1:42:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Se a minha parte for satisfatória, Ecmel, acreditar não será problema.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.46,1:42:17.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:14.58,1:42:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe com isso. Fique com a consciência tranquila.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.62,1:42:24.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:19.74,1:42:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez o seu pai também perceba que a inimizade e o ódio são coisas insignificantes perto do interesse.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.80,1:42:26.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:24.92,1:42:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.04,1:42:38.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:34.16,1:42:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Demir, você não vai fazer nenhum acordo com aquela cobra.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.91,1:42:44.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:44.03,1:42:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você está se metendo?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.11,1:42:46.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:45.23,1:42:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem está se metendo é você.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.58,1:42:50.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:47.70,1:42:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi você quem disse que, se não se divorciar de Zerrin, vai cooperar com o Cihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.51,1:42:52.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:51.63,1:42:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem está se rebaixando é você.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.56,1:42:54.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:42:53.68,1:42:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você está se metendo nisso?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.39,1:43:03.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:00.51,1:43:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai ver quem vai bater no Demir!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.77,1:43:34.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:43:32.89,1:43:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.04,1:44:01.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:00.16,1:44:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.79,1:44:04.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:02.91,1:44:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.12,1:44:12.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:10.24,1:44:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.17,1:44:16.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:15.29,1:44:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sejam bem-vindos.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.90,1:44:19.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:17.02,1:44:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dona Sadakat está esperando vocês na ponta da mesa.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.66,1:44:20.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:19.78,1:44:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela disse para não se atrasarem.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.85,1:44:22.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:20.97,1:44:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Espero que não tenha começado a dar ordens de novo.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.36,1:44:25.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:23.48,1:44:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,O Cihan está lá em cima?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.46,1:44:28.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:26.58,1:44:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No quarto dele, com certeza.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.70,1:44:30.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:28.82,1:44:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vamos.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.13,1:44:35.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:31.25,1:44:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês já devem ter saído. Fiz comidas deliciosas para vocês.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.80,1:44:43.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:41.92,1:44:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomara que a gente consiga comer.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.66,1:44:52.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:49.78,1:44:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças a Deus, está tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.42,1:44:56.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:54.54,1:44:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite. Boa noite.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.59,1:44:58.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:44:56.71,1:44:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, sirvam-se à mesa.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.94,1:45:11.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:08.06,1:45:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Todo mundo arrumado e ninguém abre a boca.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.62,1:45:22.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:20.74,1:45:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,É por causa do Boran?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.61,1:45:29.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:26.73,1:45:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus o tenha. Que descanse em paz.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.71,1:45:34.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:32.83,1:45:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Amém. Amém.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.72,1:45:39.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:36.84,1:45:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,As cestas básicas foram distribuídas na vila? Foram, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.08,1:45:42.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:40.20,1:45:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Amanhã o hoxha virá rezar
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.24,1:45:44.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:42.36,1:45:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,para o <i>Mevlüt</i>. Avisaram todo mundo?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.39,1:45:46.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:44.51,1:45:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Avisamos. Certo.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.16,1:45:48.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:46.28,1:45:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A Dona Cemile e o Sr. Salih
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.06,1:45:55.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:53.18,1:45:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,também virão amanhã para o <i>Mevlüt</i>. Quem?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.61,1:45:59.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:45:56.73,1:45:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Você se lembrou da sua sogra e do seu sogro.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.58,1:46:03.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:00.70,1:46:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim, por que eles não viriam? Eles são nossos!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.84,1:46:06.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:03.96,1:46:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Os nossos consogros virão para a reza.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.23,1:46:09.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:07.35,1:46:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A İpek também virá, eu a convidei.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.53,1:46:10.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:09.65,1:46:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela virá para o <i>Mevlüt</i>.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.43,1:46:13.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:10.55,1:46:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,E depois do <i>Mevlüt</i>, vamos conversar sobre o casamento.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.14,1:46:16.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:14.26,1:46:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Não há necessidade de esticar tanto essa história.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.56,1:46:17.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:16.68,1:46:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não nos pega bem.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.78,1:46:21.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:17.90,1:46:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos fazer um casamento digno da nossa mansão aqui e acabar logo com isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.37,1:46:24.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:22.49,1:46:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, mãe, depois conversamos sobre essas coisas.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.91,1:46:26.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:25.03,1:46:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim depois conversamos?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.41,1:46:27.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:26.53,1:46:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,O casamento vai ficar para o inverno?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.91,1:46:29.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:28.03,1:46:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,O casamento vai ser antes do verão acabar.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.77,1:46:31.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:29.89,1:46:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, olha, agora não é o momento.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.17,1:46:38.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:31.29,1:46:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando é o momento, Sr. Kaya? Quando é o momento? Olha, não fique enrolando a İpek, essa menina. Foi você quem tomou a decisão de casar. Vai levar até o fim. O contrário não nos convém.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.65,1:46:46.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:42.77,1:46:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, olha, eu tô te dizendo que vou me casar. Tô te dizendo que vou me casar, mas agora não é a hora.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.89,1:46:53.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:47.01,1:46:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom. Espera um minuto. Mãe, tem necessidade de toda essa pressa? Eles nem noivos estão ainda. Por que você tá com tanta pressa?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.13,1:46:59.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:53.25,1:46:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque eu não confio nele. A qualquer momento a cabeça dele pode voar para outro lugar. Esse assunto tem que terminar o mais rápido possível.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.77,1:47:02.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:46:59.89,1:47:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Que cabeça voar, que cabeça voar o quê?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.27,1:47:04.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:02.39,1:47:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,De onde você tira essas coisas?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.13,1:47:05.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:04.25,1:47:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, não desconte em mim.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.59,1:47:06.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:05.71,1:47:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me tire do sério, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.59,1:47:07.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:06.71,1:47:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me tire do sério.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.11,1:47:08.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:08.23,1:47:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.99,1:47:10.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:09.11,1:47:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou me casar.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.62,1:47:12.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:10.74,1:47:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não porque você tá me forçando.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.17,1:47:15.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:13.29,1:47:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu conheço bem a minha mercadoria.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.36,1:47:15.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:15.48,1:47:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tia.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.74,1:47:17.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:16.86,1:47:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tia.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.54,1:47:18.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:17.66,1:47:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês podiam pegar aqui.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.54,1:47:21.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:19.66,1:47:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mãe, amanhã sobre o casamento...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.44,1:47:22.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:21.56,1:47:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A senhora não vai dizer uma só palavra, mãe.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.11,1:47:24.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:23.23,1:47:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma só.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.98,1:47:28.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:26.10,1:47:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha para essa mulher.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.13,1:47:33.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:31.25,1:47:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.54,1:47:35.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:34.66,1:47:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pecado, pecado.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.61,1:47:37.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:35.73,1:47:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,É um pecado comer comida nesta casa.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.20,1:47:41.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:38.32,1:47:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho, vocês prepararam um banquete e tanto.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.94,1:47:45.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:47:41.06,1:47:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi até os Baybars e propôs uma trégua para o Demir?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.33,1:48:22.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:20.45,1:48:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,É, conversamos sobre algumas coisas.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.38,1:48:24.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:23.50,1:48:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,O que ele disse?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.52,1:48:25.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:24.64,1:48:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que eu não estou sabendo disso?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.34,1:48:27.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:26.46,1:48:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vai acontecer, hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.33,1:48:33.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:29.45,1:48:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo o que eu precisava saber foi enterrado por sua culpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.91,1:48:36.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:34.03,1:48:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Daqui em diante, cada um por si.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.61,1:48:37.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:36.73,1:48:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Acabou a confiança.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.89,1:48:39.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:38.01,1:48:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai haver acordo com o Demir.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.28,1:48:41.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:40.40,1:48:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai, sim.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.19,1:48:42.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:41.31,1:48:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós somos obrigados a fazer isso.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.23,1:48:44.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:42.35,1:48:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Você quer traficar drogas.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.35,1:48:47.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:44.47,1:48:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi por isso que você se aproximou do Demir, mas só por cima do meu cadáver, hein.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.35,1:48:48.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:47.47,1:48:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou permitir.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.56,1:48:51.01,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:48.68,1:48:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Que drogas? Não tem droga nenhuma.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.03,1:48:52.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:52.15,1:48:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está mentindo.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.68,1:48:54.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:53.80,1:48:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Não estou mentindo.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.74,1:48:58.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:54.86,1:48:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu passei anos preso por causa de drogas.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.15,1:49:00.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:48:59.27,1:49:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Consegui a liberdade condicional.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.79,1:49:03.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:00.91,1:49:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Você acha que eu sou tão estúpido a ponto de correr esse risco, porra?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.53,1:49:07.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:04.65,1:49:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Será apenas contrabando comum.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.72,1:49:09.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:07.84,1:49:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,E estará sob o nosso controle.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.54,1:49:13.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:10.66,1:49:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Şahin, olha, ele agora é nosso genro.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.96,1:49:18.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:17.08,1:49:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisamos nos unir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.26,1:49:22.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:19.38,1:49:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Senão, esse Cihan vai nos esmagar um por um.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.46,1:49:24.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:23.58,1:49:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Caia em si.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.31,1:49:29.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:27.43,1:49:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos adiar o casamento.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.33,1:49:36.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:35.45,1:49:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Marcamos para uma data futura.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.55,1:49:38.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:36.67,1:49:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Fazemos depois, não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.47,1:49:43.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:40.59,1:49:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você tem certeza, meu filho?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.15,1:49:52.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:45.27,1:49:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai voltar atrás depois, hein? Não machuque essa menina, não machuque a si mesmo e nem nos machuque, porque as coisas vão ficar complicadas depois.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.43,1:50:02.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:49:54.55,1:50:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não vou deixar que a maltratem por causa daquela casa, meu irmão. Eu dei minha palavra e não vou voltar atrás. O contrário disso não nos combina.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.44,1:50:11.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:03.56,1:50:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você sabe como estão as coisas agora, irmão. Nossa vida sempre foi difícil, mas depois do meu irmão Boran, eu...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.31,1:50:28.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:20.43,1:50:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,não tenho paciência para mais nada. Nem para ouvir desaforo, nem para rir, nem para sonhar com casamento. Sabe, eu não sei...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.75,1:50:37.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:34.87,1:50:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,está tudo perdido. Você...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.83,1:50:46.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:43.95,1:50:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,como você aguenta, meu irmão?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.02,1:50:55.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:50:51.14,1:50:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tia Ayca... Tudo está muito mais difícil agora, não é?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.34,1:51:05.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:04.46,1:51:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenta me recompor.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.92,1:51:11.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:09.04,1:51:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Não diga nada, irmão.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.76,1:51:21.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:16.88,1:51:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor. Sem saber da situação do meu irmão Burhan,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.10,1:51:23.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:21.22,1:51:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,por favor, não diga nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.01,1:51:40.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:37.13,1:51:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, como assim? Está melhor. Mas é claro...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.83,1:51:54.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:52.95,1:51:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,o que você espera? É normal ele ficar
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.77,1:51:57.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:54.89,1:51:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,tão abalado assim no aniversário
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.06,1:51:58.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:57.18,1:51:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,de falecimento do Burhan. Por isso ele explode desse jeito.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.97,1:52:01.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:51:59.09,1:52:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu acho que não é normal ele explodir tanto assim.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.16,1:52:04.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:03.28,1:52:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que tem outra coisa por trás.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.36,1:52:07.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:05.48,1:52:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Como motivo. Não é? Sei lá.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.39,1:52:11.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:09.51,1:52:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez ele não queira essa menina por obrigação.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.80,1:52:13.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:12.92,1:52:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ser, sim.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.05,1:52:14.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:14.17,1:52:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.12,1:52:20.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:17.24,1:52:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez o mesmo se aplique a você.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.73,1:52:23.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:21.85,1:52:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Não entendi.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.42,1:52:32.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:29.54,1:52:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez seja o mesmo no seu caso.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.58,1:52:37.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:36.70,1:52:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.65,1:52:41.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:37.77,1:52:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer dizer, deve haver algum outro motivo por trás desse seu jeito e dessa sua atitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.55,1:52:45.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:44.67,1:52:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estou entendendo o que você quer dizer.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.44,1:52:56.00,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:48.56,1:52:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não entendo como o aniversário da morte do Bora pôde te deixar tão calada e tão fechada em si mesma.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.13,1:53:00.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:52:59.25,1:53:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem outra coisa por trás disso.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.79,1:53:01.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:00.91,1:53:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,É óbvio.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.87,1:53:03.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:01.99,1:53:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem algo mais profundo.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.99,1:53:05.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:03.11,1:53:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.65,1:53:09.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:06.77,1:53:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está te afastando tanto de mim?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.46,1:53:13.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:11.58,1:53:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.80,1:53:15.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:13.92,1:53:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabe o que é isso?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.54,1:53:45.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:43.66,1:53:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua passagem para Istambul.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.45,1:53:49.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:45.57,1:53:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Justo no dia em que você disse que ia para a Síria.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.24,1:53:51.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:49.36,1:53:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde você achou isso?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.34,1:53:54.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:52.46,1:53:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Me responda.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.35,1:53:57.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:55.47,1:53:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você foi para Istambul?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.14,1:53:59.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:57.26,1:53:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Você estava revirando as minhas coisas?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.92,1:54:00.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:53:59.04,1:54:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estava revirando nada!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.26,1:54:03.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:00.38,1:54:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Que ideia, por que você fala uma coisa dessas?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.92,1:54:04.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:03.04,1:54:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Então como você achou isso?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.96,1:54:06.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:04.08,1:54:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava saindo do seu bolso, gritando para eu ver, então eu peguei.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.68,1:54:07.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:06.80,1:54:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, você pegou.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.60,1:54:10.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:07.72,1:54:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Me diga por que você mentiu para mim, por que foi para Istambul?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.72,1:54:12.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:10.84,1:54:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que escondeu de mim?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.08,1:54:13.46,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:12.20,1:54:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu precisava ir.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.27,1:54:14.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:13.39,1:54:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.28,1:54:16.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:14.40,1:54:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Me explica.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.63,1:54:20.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:18.75,1:54:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou enlouquecer.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.51,1:54:26.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:22.63,1:54:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério, eu vou enlouquecer, fico pensando nisso o tempo todo.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.48,1:54:28.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:26.60,1:54:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensei nisso de novo e de novo, para ver se era algo do trabalho.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.67,1:54:29.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:28.79,1:54:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.66,1:54:31.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:29.78,1:54:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Se fosse sobre o trabalho, você me contaria.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.79,1:54:34.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:32.91,1:54:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Se fosse brigar com alguém, também me contaria.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.31,1:54:35.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:34.43,1:54:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabe que enfrentamos as coisas juntos.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.30,1:54:39.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:37.42,1:54:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagino que não foi dar um tiro em alguém do nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.59,1:54:42.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:40.71,1:54:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,E você também não teria se envolvido com contrabando.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.15,1:54:44.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:42.27,1:54:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,De qualquer forma, isso não seria motivo para você se afastar de mim.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.99,1:54:47.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:46.11,1:54:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan, qual é o motivo?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.36,1:54:48.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:47.48,1:54:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você foi para Istambul?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.50,1:54:57.37,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:56.62,1:54:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi a Meryem?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.76,1:55:00.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:54:58.88,1:55:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A Meryem veio?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.12,1:55:04.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:02.24,1:55:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sei lá, ela foi para Istambul e você foi vê-la?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.14,1:55:06.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:05.26,1:55:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Você pode me dizer, por favor, me conta.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.48,1:55:08.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:06.60,1:55:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Só não minta para mim, me diga a verdade.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.87,1:55:09.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:08.99,1:55:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.16,1:55:10.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:10.28,1:55:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Satisfeita?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.84,1:55:11.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:10.96,1:55:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é então?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.60,1:55:13.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:11.72,1:55:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Já teve a sua resposta? Não.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.20,1:55:15.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:13.32,1:55:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, então o que é? Se não é a Meryem, o que é?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.58,1:55:18.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:16.70,1:55:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você está mentindo para mim?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.41,1:55:34.48,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:32.53,1:55:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.35,1:55:41.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:39.47,1:55:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vocês estão fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.41,1:55:43.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:41.53,1:55:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Não estamos brigando, estamos conversando, meu amor.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.78,1:55:45.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:43.90,1:55:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas vocês estão gritando muito.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.60,1:55:46.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:45.72,1:55:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.30,1:55:49.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:47.42,1:55:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ser, me desculpe, meu bebê.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.94,1:55:52.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:49.06,1:55:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Não fique triste, papai, a mamãe às vezes fica zangada assim.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.64,1:55:56.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:54.76,1:55:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu fico assim às vezes.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.10,1:56:00.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:55:56.22,1:56:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Venham, vamos fazer as pazes esta noite e deitar.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.04,1:56:01.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:00.16,1:56:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, meu amor, para o quarto.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.80,1:56:03.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:01.92,1:56:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, a gente já passou o dia todo deitado.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.93,1:56:05.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:04.05,1:56:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoje não, por favor, você diz isso?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.32,1:56:07.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:06.44,1:56:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.44,1:56:08.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:07.56,1:56:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, por favor, meu amor.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.60,1:56:10.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:09.72,1:56:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Diga boa noite para o papai.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.98,1:56:12.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:11.10,1:56:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite, papai.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.40,1:56:13.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:12.52,1:56:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa noite, meu sapinho.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.05,1:56:28.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:26.17,1:56:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem fizemos nada de mais.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.33,1:56:42.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:40.45,1:56:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos para a cama agora.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.00,1:56:47.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:45.12,1:56:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês brigaram na volta.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.70,1:56:50.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:48.82,1:56:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho, você...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.06,1:56:52.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:50.18,1:56:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não quero que a gente brigue.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.62,1:56:53.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:52.74,1:56:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,De jeito nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.81,1:56:58.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:56:55.93,1:56:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não estamos brigando.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.11,1:57:04.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:00.23,1:57:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Se não há problema, então viva essa vida lindamente.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.61,1:57:08.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:04.73,1:57:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Enquanto você não diz isso, eu tento respirar, mas...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.18,1:57:48.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:45.30,1:57:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...é como se o meu peito fosse se estreitando a cada respiração.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.75,1:57:50.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:49.87,1:57:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso me aperta por dentro.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.52,1:57:53.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:52.64,1:57:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso consome o meu peito.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.74,1:57:56.56,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:54.86,1:57:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nazım Açık.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.29,1:57:58.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:57.41,1:57:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,É assim que vou me salvar.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.60,1:58:06.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:57:58.72,1:58:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha razão, refugiada da noite, minha tristeza, meu coração que não volta, tenho medo, linda, tenho medo.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.64,1:59:43.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,1:59:35.76,1:59:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha razão, refugiada da noite, minha tristeza, meu coração que não volta, meu coração vai se partir.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.78,2:01:29.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:01:25.90,2:01:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Diz que está doendo muito, fica chorando sem parar.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.42,2:02:23.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:22.54,2:02:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Abra a boca, abra a boca.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.56,2:02:25.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:23.68,2:02:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, está doendo.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.10,2:02:28.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:25.22,2:02:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Se não abrirmos a boca, não podemos ver. Vamos abrir para ver o que é.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.74,2:02:29.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:28.86,2:02:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Deniz!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.77,2:02:35.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:33.89,2:02:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.65,2:02:37.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:35.77,2:02:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tire uma foto.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.49,2:02:39.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:37.61,2:02:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamãe, é o meu.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.65,2:02:41.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:39.77,2:02:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,De quem é isso?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.17,2:02:45.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:41.29,2:02:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, querido, primeiro preciso dar uma olhada. Vamos, meu grandão.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.13,2:02:47.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:46.25,2:02:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.80,2:02:48.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:47.92,2:02:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.99,2:02:51.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:49.11,2:02:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que é dor de dente?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.75,2:02:52.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:51.87,2:02:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Abra para eu ver.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.91,2:02:53.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:53.03,2:02:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Abra.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.54,2:02:55.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:53.66,2:02:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Abra bem, rapaz. Abra, abra.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.83,2:02:57.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:55.95,2:02:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Abra.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.89,2:02:58.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:58.01,2:02:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Está estragado.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.12,2:03:01.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:02:59.24,2:03:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi, filho? Está estragado?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.78,2:03:02.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:01.90,2:03:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é nada. É uma cárie pequena.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.80,2:03:04.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:02.92,2:03:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, filho, não é nada demais.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.42,2:03:06.31,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:04.54,2:03:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,São dentes de leite. Arranca e passa.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.12,2:03:08.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:06.24,2:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não arranquem, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.43,2:03:09.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:08.55,2:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim? Ora essa.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.74,2:03:12.67,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:09.86,2:03:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,É dente de leite, filho. Outro vai nascer no lugar.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.54,2:03:13.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:12.66,2:03:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.22,2:03:15.32,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:13.34,2:03:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa ser arrancado assim.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.13,2:03:17.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:15.25,2:03:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós não vamos arrancar.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.11,2:03:20.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:19.23,2:03:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos ao dentista.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.19,2:03:22.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:20.31,2:03:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai olhar e tratar.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.83,2:03:23.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:21.95,2:03:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai acontecer nada, tá bom?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.43,2:03:24.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:23.55,2:03:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, vamos nessa então.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.83,2:03:25.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:24.95,2:03:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha cá.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.59,2:03:26.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:25.71,2:03:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai doer?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.47,2:03:27.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:26.59,2:03:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai doer, né?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.56,2:03:29.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:28.68,2:03:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai doer.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.38,2:03:31.09,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:29.50,2:03:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou pegar minha bolsa e já volto.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.14,2:03:32.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:31.26,2:03:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, olha, olha só o que ele tá dizendo.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.78,2:03:33.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:32.90,2:03:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai doer.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.40,2:03:35.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:33.52,2:03:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu também arrancaram, não sentia nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.44,2:03:36.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:35.56,2:03:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Não arrancaram o seu.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.96,2:03:37.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:36.08,2:03:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,É, não arrancaram o meu.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.18,2:03:39.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:37.30,2:03:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Trataram e não doeu nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.26,2:03:42.07,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:39.38,2:03:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, meu chapa, força aí, amigão.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.02,2:03:43.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:42.14,2:03:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto, veja que não vai acontecer nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.30,2:03:45.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:44.42,2:03:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai doer?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.20,2:03:46.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:45.32,2:03:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.13,2:03:49.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:47.25,2:03:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos entrar, pessoal.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.62,2:03:51.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:49.74,2:03:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Esses aí também sabem de tudo.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.30,2:03:52.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:51.42,2:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse dente vai ser extraído.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.12,2:03:54.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:53.24,2:03:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.18,2:03:54.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:54.30,2:03:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.26,2:03:56.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:55.38,2:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.34,2:03:56.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:56.46,2:03:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.88,2:03:57.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:57.00,2:03:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos abrir.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.28,2:03:58.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:57.40,2:03:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Faça outra coisa.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.44,2:03:59.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:58.56,2:03:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Rápido, rápido.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.31,2:03:59.94,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:59.43,2:03:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem rápido.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.85,2:04:01.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:03:59.97,2:04:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,O dente do menino estragou por sua culpa.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.51,2:04:02.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:01.63,2:04:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ficou dando chocolates a ele.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.73,2:04:03.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:02.85,2:04:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.27,2:04:05.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:03.39,2:04:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,E essa aí joga a culpa de tudo em cima de mim.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.17,2:04:07.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:05.29,2:04:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que foi você que deu melão gelado à noite?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.23,2:04:09.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:07.35,2:04:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, se a criança ficar resfriada, será que ela te dedura?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.91,2:04:10.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:09.03,2:04:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro, olha, tava gelado, hein?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.47,2:04:11.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:10.59,2:04:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tava gelado?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.16,2:04:12.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:12.28,2:04:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tava.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.38,2:04:14.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:14.50,2:04:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.00,2:04:17.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:15.12,2:04:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha aqui, moça, não pise descalça no chão.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.06,2:04:19.27,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:18.18,2:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai pegar friagem nos pés.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.44,2:04:21.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:19.56,2:04:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Juro que você vai ficar resfriada e não vai poder ter filhos. Eu quero netos.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.05,2:04:22.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:22.17,2:04:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.84,2:04:25.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:23.96,2:04:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.46,2:04:28.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:26.58,2:04:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você disse, Kadir?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.80,2:04:29.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:28.92,2:04:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu disse resfriada.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.79,2:04:31.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:29.91,2:04:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu disse resfriada. E o que mais você disse?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.83,2:04:32.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:31.95,2:04:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Resfriada, resfriada.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.59,2:04:34.36,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:32.71,2:04:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, eu digo sobre o filho. O que você disse?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.17,2:04:35.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:34.29,2:04:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou te mostrar, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.22,2:04:40.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:39.34,2:04:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos ver.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.79,2:04:45.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:42.91,2:04:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossa, não doeu nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.60,2:04:48.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:45.72,2:04:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Não foi? Eu te falei. Não tem nada para ter medo.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.34,2:04:53.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:48.46,2:04:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas olha só. Só porque não doeu, você não vai comer tudo de uma vez, né? Aqueles doces.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.74,2:04:54.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:53.86,2:04:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.13,2:04:55.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:55.25,2:04:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito bem.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.39,2:05:00.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:04:57.51,2:05:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Papai, os nossos negócios são por aqui?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.42,2:05:04.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:01.54,2:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, olha. Vê aquela rua ali na frente, meu amor?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.66,2:05:06.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:04.78,2:05:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Passando por lá, fica bem perto daqui.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.24,2:05:09.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:07.36,2:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Me leve embora, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.10,2:05:12.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:10.22,2:05:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, eu te levo, mas...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.69,2:05:18.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:15.81,2:05:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Estes dias a situação tá meio complicada, depois eu te levo, tá bom?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.99,2:05:18.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:18.11,2:05:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Promessa.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.83,2:05:24.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:21.95,2:05:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Se a gente ficar por aqui...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.07,2:05:30.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:28.19,2:05:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu filho, o que a gente acabou de te falar?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.20,2:05:32.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:31.32,2:05:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,O que que tem o doce?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.67,2:05:34.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:32.79,2:05:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Só um, hein? Vamos lá.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.93,2:05:35.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:34.05,2:05:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamãe, só um pouquinho.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.89,2:05:39.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:37.01,2:05:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem pouquinho, hein.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.99,2:05:41.34,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:40.11,2:05:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nada de pedir muito.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.17,2:05:41.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:41.29,2:05:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem pouquinho.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.73,2:05:43.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:41.85,2:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, vai.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.84,2:05:48.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:45.96,2:05:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Não corre, não corre sem olhar, meu filho.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.87,2:05:55.95,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:52.99,2:05:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamãe, sabia? Eu conheço esse tio.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.21,2:06:01.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:05:58.33,2:06:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá, venha aqui. Desculpem. Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.34,2:06:07.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:02.46,2:06:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamãe, esse tio... Ele trabalhava no restaurante do papai antes.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.83,2:06:14.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:12.95,2:06:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.74,2:06:19.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:17.86,2:06:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não me reconheceu, tio?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.53,2:06:23.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:21.65,2:06:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me reconheceu, tio Vurgun?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.72,2:06:27.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:24.84,2:06:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ora, como eu não ia te reconhecer?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.17,2:06:29.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:27.29,2:06:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu leãozinho! Como você cresceu, hein?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.22,2:06:31.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:30.34,2:06:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,É.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.20,2:06:32.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:31.32,2:06:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito bem.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.19,2:06:35.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:33.31,2:06:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês trabalhavam com o Boran?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.25,2:06:37.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:35.37,2:06:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim. Vurgun Kelebi.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.07,2:06:38.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:37.19,2:06:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, Deniz.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.01,2:06:41.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:39.13,2:06:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me lembro do senhor, desculpe.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.07,2:06:42.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:41.19,2:06:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que vocês estão aqui agora?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.29,2:06:50.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:45.41,2:06:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai lá pegar mais meia bola de sorvete para você, meu garoto.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.62,2:06:54.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:52.74,2:06:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Vurgun trabalhava para mim?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.05,2:06:58.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:06:55.17,2:06:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando mandaram ele para fora da cidade pela primeira vez, ele foi comigo, graças a Deus.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.62,2:07:03.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:00.74,2:07:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu nunca o vi no funeral nem nada.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.40,2:07:04.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:03.52,2:07:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando vocês voltaram?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.48,2:07:07.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:05.60,2:07:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Já faz alguns meses.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.01,2:07:15.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:12.13,2:07:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não vieram assim que perderam o chefe?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.88,2:07:18.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:16.00,2:07:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha mãe estava doente, eu estava em Istambul há um bom tempo.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.78,2:07:20.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:18.90,2:07:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas agora ela melhorou, graças a Deus.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.39,2:07:23.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:20.51,2:07:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Estavam em Istambul. Melhoras para ela.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.43,2:07:28.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:27.55,2:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.74,2:07:29.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:28.86,2:07:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.55,2:07:32.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:30.67,2:07:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Peguei bem pouquinho.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.93,2:07:33.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:32.05,2:07:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi pouco mesmo? Tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.39,2:07:36.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:33.51,2:07:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Se não tiver mais nada para falar, tio Vurgun, a gente se fala depois.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.46,2:07:37.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:36.58,2:07:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos indo.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.57,2:07:38.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:37.69,2:07:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.42,2:07:42.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:40.54,2:07:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.01,2:07:43.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:43.13,2:07:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.30,2:07:46.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:45.42,2:07:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, Deniz.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.34,2:07:49.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:48.46,2:07:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Papai.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.16,2:07:50.61,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:50.28,2:07:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Diga.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.09,2:07:55.41,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:51.21,2:07:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabe de uma coisa? Hoje é aniversário da morte do meu pai.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.28,2:07:59.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:07:55.40,2:07:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,É, hoje tem a reza. Vamos homenageá-lo. Por isso vou voltar mais cedo.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.89,2:08:04.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:03.01,2:08:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dê valor à sua mãe.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.17,2:08:07.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:06.29,2:08:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos nos congelar.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.74,2:08:27.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:25.86,2:08:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,É.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.30,2:08:43.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:39.42,2:08:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua passagem para Istambul. Logo no dia em que disse que ia para a Síria.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.06,2:08:45.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:44.18,2:08:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde achou isso?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.93,2:08:49.96,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:45.05,2:08:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Me diga por que mentiu. Por que foi para Istambul? Por que escondeu de mim?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.83,2:08:50.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:49.95,2:08:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu precisava ir.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.06,2:08:52.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:52.18,2:08:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.25,2:08:55.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:54.37,2:08:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.95,2:08:59.10,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:57.07,2:08:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas por que vocês não vieram quando perderam essa porcentagem?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.30,2:09:01.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:08:59.42,2:09:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha mãe estava do মানুষের. Estava em Istambul havia um bom tempo.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.89,2:09:03.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:02.01,2:09:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês estavam em Istambul.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.34,2:09:22.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:18.46,2:09:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigado. Como o senhor está, como tem passado?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.09,2:09:39.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:37.21,2:09:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças a você, estou muito melhor. Obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.87,2:09:44.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:39.99,2:09:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, que ótimo. Mas continue tomando os seus remédios, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.60,2:09:50.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:46.72,2:09:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que posso te pedir um pequeno favor?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.26,2:09:54.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:51.38,2:09:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer dizer, preciso da sua ajuda. Eu sei.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.93,2:09:57.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:55.05,2:09:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai pegar bem, mas é muito importante para mim.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:57.66,2:10:01.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:09:57.78,2:10:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro, se for algo em que eu possa ajudar, estou ouvindo. Pode falar, Alya.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.19,2:10:06.53,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:03.31,2:10:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Se eu te der o número de um bilhete...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.19,2:10:09.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:07.31,2:10:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Poderia verificar quem viajou?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.99,2:10:11.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:10.11,2:10:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,É... veja bem.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.08,2:10:13.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:12.20,2:10:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Normalmente é proibido.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.62,2:10:17.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:14.74,2:10:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas vou abrir uma exceção para você.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.13,2:10:18.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:17.25,2:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou te ouvindo.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.46,2:10:19.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:18.58,2:10:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.19,2:10:23.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:21.31,2:10:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,235.77.89.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.47,2:10:26.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:23.59,2:10:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece ser um voo para Istambul.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.99,2:10:29.22,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:27.11,2:10:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Os seguintes nomes constam na reserva.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.10,2:10:33.76,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:30.22,2:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Cihan Albora, Kadir Yolcu, Muzaffer Sancak.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.84,2:10:37.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:34.96,2:10:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,E tem reserva de volta?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.10,2:10:44.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:43.22,2:10:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou verificar.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.98,2:10:47.55,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:45.10,2:10:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, Alya, não consta nenhuma reserva de volta.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.59,2:10:50.91,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:48.71,2:10:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada, Şükran.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.76,2:10:53.11,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:50.88,2:10:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu que agradeço, tenha um bom dia.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.59,2:11:02.93,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:10:59.71,2:11:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está bem? Aconteceu alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.68,2:11:08.51,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:04.80,2:11:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,É que... São problemas de trabalho, coisas que chateiam.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.87,2:11:14.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:08.99,2:11:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem a ver com a busca, né? Tem algo nos carros que eu deveria me preocupar?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.20,2:11:18.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:16.32,2:11:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.88,2:11:36.71,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:32.00,2:11:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Doutora Alya, vamos levar o paciente para a sala de cirurgia.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.41,2:11:50.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:11:48.53,2:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Já vou, preparem tudo que estou indo.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.00,2:12:02.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:00.12,2:12:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Então eu já vou indo.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.07,2:12:12.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:08.19,2:12:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, querida, eu também vou para a mansão, para o culto.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.63,2:12:15.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:12.75,2:12:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem dera eu também pudesse ir.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.54,2:12:19.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:17.66,2:12:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos, eu te deixo lá.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.97,2:12:24.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:21.09,2:12:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não. Pode ir, eu vou sozinha.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.86,2:12:27.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:26.98,2:12:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:28.75,2:12:29.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:28.87,2:12:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não a levou?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.49,2:12:31.78,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:29.61,2:12:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não, não precisa mesmo. Já estou saindo.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.11,2:12:36.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:12:33.23,2:12:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Enfim, levante-se. Até logo, querida.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.38,2:13:03.45,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:01.50,2:13:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.04,2:13:09.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:08.16,2:13:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu alguma coisa, Nare? O que você está fazendo aqui?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.35,2:13:13.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:10.47,2:13:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, eu precisava sair de casa. Eu tinha dito ao Şahin que viria para o culto.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.21,2:13:16.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:14.33,2:13:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Além disso, quero ver meu irmão também. Quando vocês... Eu...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.83,2:13:19.26,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:15.95,2:13:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, você vem aqui o tempo todo, vem e vai sempre, está chamando atenção.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.40,2:13:21.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:19.52,2:13:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, eu estou tomando cuidado, não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.45,2:13:22.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:21.57,2:13:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai acabar dando corda para o Şahin.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:23.57,2:13:26.64,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:23.69,2:13:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Irmão, de verdade, estou tomando cuidado. Muito cuidado.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:27.30,2:13:28.20,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:27.42,2:13:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Você.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.50,2:13:30.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:13:28.62,2:13:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, né? Pode falar.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.35,2:14:06.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:02.47,2:14:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sobre o quê? Olha, se for sobre esse assunto do acordo, nem comece, não tenho tempo agora.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.05,2:14:08.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:07.17,2:14:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,É outro assunto.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.72,2:14:09.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:08.84,2:14:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode falar.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:10.72,2:14:12.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:10.84,2:14:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sobre o quê?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.66,2:14:20.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:17.78,2:14:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te ligam mais tarde.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.64,2:14:28.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:27.76,2:14:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você está dizendo, irmão?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:28.79,2:14:31.87,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:14:28.91,2:14:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nada, sério, é esse negócio do acordo. Anda, vai andando.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:59.96,2:15:02.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:00.08,2:15:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tipo o quê?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.82,2:15:34.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:30.94,2:15:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não quis falar no dia, por isso.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.08,2:15:40.14,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:15:38.20,2:15:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu quero muito.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:08.96,2:16:11.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:09.08,2:16:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Deus tenha misericórdia dele.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:30.12,2:16:31.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:30.24,2:16:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Que o céu seja seu lugar.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.53,2:16:32.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:31.65,2:16:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu querido.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.51,2:16:33.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:32.63,2:16:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu querido.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.85,2:16:38.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:36.97,2:16:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Com licença, fiquem em pé.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.47,2:16:40.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:16:38.59,2:16:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Ele aceite.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.48,2:17:11.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:10.60,2:17:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Que Alá aceite.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.01,2:17:12.68,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:12.13,2:17:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Amém.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.79,2:17:16.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:12.91,2:17:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu pai ouve nossas orações, não é, mãe?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.06,2:17:19.13,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:17.18,2:17:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro que ouve.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:21.15,2:17:23.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:21.27,2:17:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu pai ouve tudo o que você diz.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.15,2:17:26.06,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:24.27,2:17:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele te ouve de todo lugar.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.71,2:17:30.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:27.83,2:17:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,O imam veio lá de baixo, o que estão esperando?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:30.65,2:17:31.80,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:30.77,2:17:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, vamos.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:33.10,2:17:33.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:33.22,2:17:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.13,2:17:48.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:17:44.25,2:17:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Trate com misericórdia o Teu servo reunido para se despedir.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:00.12,2:18:01.04,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:00.24,2:18:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Amém.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:00.89,2:18:02.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:01.01,2:18:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Faça do paraíso a sua morada.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.33,2:18:03.44,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:02.45,2:18:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Amém.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:03.57,2:18:09.83,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:03.69,2:18:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dá paciência, firmeza e discernimento ao seu filho, à sua família e aos que o amam.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.78,2:18:11.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:10.90,2:18:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Amém.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.68,2:18:14.73,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:11.80,2:18:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,E louvado seja Alá, Senhor dos Mundos.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:14.64,2:18:16.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:14.76,2:18:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Com a Fatiha.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.91,2:18:28.98,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:28.03,2:18:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:28.35,2:18:29.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:28.47,2:18:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Senhora Sadakat, o que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.57,2:18:30.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:29.69,2:18:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:31.00,2:18:32.70,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:31.12,2:18:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,O nível de oxigênio no sangue caiu.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.55,2:18:33.66,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:32.67,2:18:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou intervir imediatamente.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.61,2:18:34.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:33.73,2:18:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Como assim caiu?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:34.50,2:18:35.62,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:34.62,2:18:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele não está conseguindo respirar?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:35.49,2:18:36.82,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:35.61,2:18:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,O que isso significa? Não entendi.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:36.63,2:18:37.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:36.75,2:18:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Chame o médico logo.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.41,2:18:39.28,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:37.53,2:18:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que esses aparelhos estão apitando tanto?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.31,2:18:40.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:39.43,2:18:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês fizeram alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.27,2:18:41.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:40.39,2:18:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele fez alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.05,2:18:41.58,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:41.17,2:18:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.80,2:18:43.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:41.92,2:18:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Não pode ser, mas um minuto, o que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.96,2:18:44.89,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:43.08,2:18:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,O nível de oxigênio no sangue caiu.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.82,2:18:45.69,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:44.94,2:18:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chame ele aqui.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.74,2:18:46.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:45.86,2:18:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, doutor.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:47.14,2:18:48.35,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:47.26,2:18:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, fiquem calmos.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.18,2:18:48.97,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:48.30,2:18:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,O médico está chegando.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.82,2:18:49.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:48.94,2:18:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, se acalmem.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.12,2:18:54.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:52.24,2:18:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Que a irmã Sevda leve vocês.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.76,2:18:56.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:55.88,2:18:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Que a irmã cuide disso.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.67,2:18:57.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:56.79,2:18:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigado.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:57.11,2:18:58.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(0,0)\p1}m 120 555 l 1160 555 1160 695 120 695{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,2:18:57.23,2:18:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigado.
